hadiths[113]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1599","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Arqam (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, un se kaha gaya: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kitney ghazwe kiye? Unhon-ne kaha: Unnees. Kaha gaya: Tum Aap key sath kitney mein ghazwe mein gaey? Unhon-ne kaha: Satrah. Main ne kaha: Un mein pehla kaunsa tha? Unhon-ne kaha: Usaira ya Usheira. To main ne Qataada se zikr kya. To unhon-ne kaha: Usheira. (Bukhari: 3949). Badr key ghazwe ki kahaani."
"1600","[AI-translation] Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Miqdaad bin Aswad ka mashhad dekha. Kaash main uska saathi hota, wo mujhey us se zyada mehboob hai jo uskey badley diya gaya. Wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey jabke Aap mushrikeen par baddua kar rahey they. To unhon-ne kaha: Ham Musa ki qaum jaisa na kahengey: (Tum jao aur tumhaara Rab, lad o). Lekin ham tumhaarey daaen aur tumhaarey baaen aur tumharey saamney aur tumharey peechey ladengey. To main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha ke Aapka chehra roshan hua aur Aap khush huey. (Bukhari: 3952)"
"1601","[AI-translation] Bara (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Mujh se Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sahaaba mein se jinhon-ne Badr mein haazri di thi bayan kya ke wo Taaloot key sahaaba ki ginti they jo uskey sath nehar se guzrey they. Teen sau se zyada. Bara ne kaha: Nahi, Allah ki qasam! Uskey sath nehar se momin key siwa na guzra. (Bukhari: 3957)"
"1602","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kaun dekhayga ke Abu Jahl ne kya kya? To Ibn Masood chaley. To unhon-ne use paaya jabke use Afra key donon beton ne maara tha yahan tak ke wo thanda ho chuka tha. Unhon-ne kaha: Kya tum Abu Jahl ho? Unhon-ne kaha: To us ne uski daadhi pakdi. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur aadmi se upar kya hai jise tum ne qatl kya. Ya aadmi jise uski qaum ne qatl kya. (Bukhari: 3963)"
"1603","[AI-translation] Abu Talha (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Allah key Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Badr key din Quraish key sardaaron mein se chaubees aadmiyon ka hukm diya. To wo Badr key ganday kuwein mein phenkay gaey. Aur Aap jab qaum par ghaalib aatey to maidaan mein teen raatein thehartey. Phir jab Badr mein teesra din tha to Aap ne apni oontni ka hukm diya aur us par uska kajawa kasa gaya. Phir Aap chaley aur Aap key sahaaba Aap key peechey chaley. Aur unhon-ne kaha: Ham nahi samajhtey ke Aap jaatey hain magar apni baaz haajat key liye. Yahan tak ke Aap kuwein key kinarey par khadey huey. To unhey unkey naamon aur unkey baapon key naamon se pukaarney lagey: Ae fulaan bin fulaan! Aur ae fulaan bin fulaan! Kya tumhey khush karega ke tum ne Allah aur uskey Rasool ki itaat ki hoti. Beshak ham ne paa liya hai jo hamaarey Rab ne ham se waada kya tha haq hai. To kya tum ne paa liya hai jo tumharey Rab ne waada kya tha haq hai? Unhon-ne kaha: To Umar ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Tum jisamon se kya baat kartey ho jin mein roohein nahi hain? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qasam us zaat ki jiskey haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Tum jo main kehta hun use un se zyada sun-ney waley nahi ho. (Bukhari: 3976)"
"1604","[AI-translation] Rifaa bin Raafe Zarqi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, aur wo Badr walon mein se they, unhon-ne kaha: Jibreel Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey. To unhon-ne kaha: Tum Badr walon ko apne darmiyaan kya shumaar kartey ho? Aap ne farmaya: Musalmaanon mein sab se afzal. Ya us jaisa kalimat. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur aise hi farishton mein se jo Badr mein haazir hua. (Bukhari: 3992)"
"1605","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Badr key din farmaya: Ye Jibreel hain jo apne ghodey ka sar pakdey huey hain jabke us par ladai ka saamaan hai. (Bukhari: 3995)"
"1606","[AI-translation] Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne kaha: Main Badr key din Ubaida bin Saeed bin Aas se mila jabke wo hathiyaar mein dhaka hua tha, us mein se uski aankhon key siwa nazar nahi aata tha. Jabke usey Abu Zaat-ul-Karish kunniyat di jaati thi. To us ne kaha: Main Abu Zaat-ul-Karish hun. To main ne us par chhote nezeh se hamla kya aur uski aankh mein maara aur wo mara. Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne us par apna paon rakkha, phir zor lagaaya. To mushkil se use kheench saka jabke uskey donon kinarey mur gaey they. Urwa ne kaha: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se use maanga aur us ne dey diya. Phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) faut ho gaey to use (wapas) liya. Phir Abu Bakr ne use maanga aur us ne dey diya. Phir jab Abu Bakr faut ho gaey to Umar ne us se use maanga aur us ne use dey diya. Phir jab Umar faut ho gaey to use (wapas) liya. Phir Usmaan ne us se use maanga aur us ne use dey diya. Phir jab Usmaan qatl kiye gaey to wo Aale Ali key paas waaqe hua. To Abdullah bin Zubair ne use maanga aur wo uskey paas thi yahan tak ke wo qatl kya gaya. (Bukhari: 3998)"
"1607","[AI-translation] Rubayyi bint Muawwiz (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) merey paas us subah tashreef laaey jab mujh se nikaah kya gaya tha. To Aap merey bistar par baithey jaisey tum mujh se baithey ho. Jabke chhoti ladkiyaan daf bajaati thein aur merey baapon mein se jo Badr key din qatl kiye gaey they unka sog manaaten. Yahan tak ke londi ne kaha: Aur ham mein Nabi hai jo jaanta hai jo kal mein hai. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aisa na kaho. Aur kaho jo tum kehti thein. (Bukhari: 4001)"
"1608","[AI-translation] Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key saathi Abu Talha (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, aur wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Badr mein haazir huey they, ke unhon-ne kaha: Farishtey ghar mein daakhil nahi hotey jismein kutta aur tasweer ho. (Bukhari: 4002)"
"1609","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Khunais bin Huzaafa Sahmi se Hafsa bint Umar bewa huin. Jabke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sahaaba mein se they jinhon-ne Badr mein haazri di thi, Madina mein faut huey. Umar ne kaha: To main Usmaan bin Affaan se mila aur us par Hafsa pesh ki. To main ne kaha: Agar chaaaho to main tum se Hafsa bint Umar ka nikaah kar dun. Unhon-ne kaha: Main apne muamley mein dekhunga. To main raatein thehra. To unhon-ne kaha: Mujhey raey aai hai ke main aaj nikaah na karun. Umar ne kaha: To main Abu Bakr se mila aur main ne kaha: Agar chaaaho to main tum se Hafsa bint Umar ka nikaah kar dun. To Abu Bakr khaamosh rahey aur mujhey kuchh jawaab na diya. To main us par Usmaan se zyada naaraaz tha. To main raatein thehra. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uska nikaah paighaam bheja aur main ne uska Aap se nikaah kar diya. To mujh se Abu Bakr milay aur unhon-ne kaha: Shayed tum mujh par naaraaz huey jab main ne tum par Hafsa pesh ki aur main ne tumhey jawaab na diya? Main ne kaha: Haan. Unhon-ne kaha: Mujhey tumhey jawaab deney se sirf ye mana kya ke main jaan chuka tha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uska zikr kya tha. To main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka raaz kholney wala na tha. Aur agar wo use chhor detey to main use qabool karta. (Bukhari: 4005)"
"1610","[AI-translation] Abu Masood Badri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Surat-ul-Baqarah key aakhir ki do aayatein, jo unhey raat mein padhey wo usey kaafi hongi. (Bukhari: 4008)"
"1611","[AI-translation] Bani Zuhra key halif aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Badr mein haazir honay walon mein Miqdaad bin Aswad Kindi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne Aap ko khabar di ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha: Bataaiye agar main kaafiron mein se aadmi se milun aur ham ladain aur wo talwaar se mera aik haath kaat kar juda kar dey, phir wo mujh se darkht ki panaah ley aur kahey: Main Allah key liye Musalman hua. Kya main use qatl karun Ya Rasulullah, uskey kehney key baad? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use qatl na karo. To us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak us ne mera aik haath kaata hai, phir us ne wo uskey kaatney key baad kaha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use qatl na karo. Phir agar tum ne use qatl kya to wo tumhaarey martabey mein hai us se pehley ke tum use qatl karo. Aur beshak tum uskey martabey mein ho us se pehley ke wo uska kalimat kahey jo us ne kaha. (Bukhari: 4019)"
"1612","[AI-translation] Jubair bin Mutim (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Badr key qaidiyon key baarey mein farmaya: Kaash Mutim bin Adi zinda hota, phir wo mujh se in ganday key baarey mein baat karta to main unhey uskey liye chhor deta. (Bukhari: 4024). Bani Nazeer ki hadees."
"1613","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nazeer aur Quraiza ne ladai ki. To Bani Nazeer ko jilawatan kya aur Quraiza ko rakkha aur un par ehsaan kya. Yahan tak ke Quraiza ne ladai ki. To unkey ladney walon ko qatl kya aur unki auraton aur unki aulaad aur unkey maalon ko Musalmaanon key darmiyaan taqseem kya. Magar un mein se baaz Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se jaa milay aur Aap ne unhey aman di aur wo Musalman ho gaey. Aur Madina key Yahood sab ko jilawatan kya: Bani Qainuqaa, aur wo Abdullah bin Salaam ki qaum hain, aur Bani Haaritha key Yahood aur Madina key har Yahood ko. (Bukhari: 4028)"
"1614","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Bani Nazeer ki khajoorein jalaain aur kaaten. Aur wo Buwaira hai. To naazil hui: (Jo tum ne narm khajooron mein se kaaten ya unhey unki jadon par khada chhora to Allah key izn se). (Bukhari: 4031)"
"1615","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwiyon ne Usmaan ko Abu Bakr ki taraf bheja jo un se unka aathwaan hissa maangtey jo Allah ne apne Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par maal-e-fai kya tha. To main unhey rokti thi. To main ne un se kaha: Kya tum Allah se nahi darten? Kya tum nahi jaanten ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmaatey they: Ham waasris na banaatey hain. Jo ham ne chhoda wo sadqa hai, uskey sath Aap apne aap ka iraada kartey they. Beshak Aale Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) is maal mein khaatey hain. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwiyaan us par ruk gaein jo main ne unhey khabar di thi. (Bukhari: 4034). Kaab bin Ashraf ka qatl."
"1616","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kaab bin Ashraf key liye kaun hai? Beshak us ne Allah aur uskey Rasool ko takleef di hai. To Muhammad bin Maslama khadey huey aur unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya tum pasand kartey ho ke main use qatl karun? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. Unhon-ne kaha: To mujhey ijazat dijiye ke main kuchh kahun. Aap ne farmaya: Kaho. To Muhammad bin Maslama uskey paas aey aur unhon-ne kaha: Beshak is aadmi ne ham se sadqa maanga hai. Aur beshak us ne hamein mashaqqat mein daala hai. Aur beshak main tumharey paas tum se qarz maangney aaya hun. Us ne kaha: Aur phir, Allah ki qasam tum use ukta jaaogey! Unhon-ne kaha: Beshak ham ne uski pairwi ki hai. To ham pasand nahi kartey ke use chhorein yahan tak ke ham dekhein ke uska muamla kis par hota hai. Aur ham ne chaaha hai ke tum hamein aik ya do wasaq qarz do. To us ne kaha: Haan, mujhey girwi rakkho. Unhon-ne kaha: Tum kya chaaahtey ho? Us ne kaha: Mujhey apni auratein girwi rakkho. Unhon-ne kaha: Ham tumhey apni auratein kaisey girwi rakkhein jabke tum Arab mein sab se haseen ho? Us ne kaha: To mujhey apne betey girwi rakkho. Unhon-ne kaha: Ham tumhey apne betey kaisey girwi rakkhein ke un mein se kisi ko taana diya jaaeyga aur kaha jaaeyga: Aik ya do wasaq key badley girwi rakkha gaya? Ye ham par aar hai. Lekin ham tumhey hathiyaar girwi rakhtey hain. To us ne us se waada kya ke wo uskey paas aaeyga. To wo raat ko uskey paas aaya jabke uskey sath Abu Naela tha. Aur wo Kaab ka doodh shareek bhai tha. To unhon-ne unhey qile ki taraf bulaaya aur wo unki taraf utra. To uski biwi ne us se kaha: Tum is waqt kahaan nikaltey ho? To us ne kaha: Wo Muhammad bin Maslama aur mera bhai Abu Naela hain. Us ne kaha: Main aawaaz sunti hun goya us se khoon tapakta hai. Us ne kaha: Wo mera bhai Muhammad bin Maslama aur mera doodh shareek Abu Naela hain. Beshak shareef ko agar raat ko nezey ki taraf bulaaya jaey to wo jawaab dega. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur Muhammad bin Maslama apne sath do aadmi daakhil karta hai. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Abu Abs bin Jabr aur Haaris bin Aus aur Abbaad bin Bishr. To us ne kaha: Jab wo aaey to main uskey baal pakad kar soonghunga. Phir jab tum mujhey uskey sar par qaabu paata hua dekho to tumhaara kaam hai, use maarna. Aur aik martaba kaha: Phir main tumhey soonghaaunga. To wo unki taraf utra jabke wo chaadar odhey huey tha aur us se khushbu ki hawaa aa rahi thi. To us ne kaha: Main ne aaj jaisi khushbu nahi dekhi, yaani umda. Unhon-ne kaha: Merey paas Arab ki auraton mein sab se khushbudaar aur Arab mein sab se kaamil hain. To us ne kaha: Kya tum mujhey ijazat detey ho ke main tumhaara sar soonghun? Us ne kaha: Haan. To us ne use soongha, phir apne saathiyon ko soonghaaya. Phir us ne kaha: Kya tum mujhey ijazat detey ho? Us ne kaha: Haan. Phir jab wo us par qaabu paa gaya to us ne kaha: Tumhaara kaam! To unhon-ne use qatl kar diya. Phir wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey aur Aap ko khabar di. (Bukhari: 4037). Abu Raafe Abdullah bin Abil Huqaiq ka qatl, aur kaha jaata hai Salaam bin Abil Huqaiq."
"1617","[AI-translation] Bara (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Yahoodi Abu Raafe ki taraf Ansaar mein se aadmi bhejey. To un par Abdullah bin Ateek ko muqarrar kya. Jabke Abu Raafe Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko takleef deta tha aur Aap key khilaaf madad karta tha. Aur wo Hijaaz ki zameen mein apne qile mein tha. Phir jab wo uskey qareeb aey jabke sooraj ghurub ho chuka tha aur log apne jaanvaron key sath wapas aa chukey they. To Abdullah ne apne saathiyon se kaha: Apni jagah baithey raho. Beshak main daarbaan ki taraf jaa raha hun aur narmi kar raha hun, shayed main daakhil hun. To wo aaya yahan tak ke darwaazey key qareeb hua. Phir us ne apne kapdey se munh dhaanpa goya wo haajat poori karta hai jabke log daakhil ho chukey they. To daarbaan ne use pukaara: Ae Abdullah! Agar tum daakhil hona chaaahtey ho to daakhil ho. Beshak main darwaaza band karna chahta hun. To main daakhil hua aur chhup gaya. Phir jab log daakhil huey to us ne darwaaza band kar diya, phir kundiyaan keel par latka deen. Unhon-ne kaha: To main chaabiyon ki taraf utha aur unhey liya aur darwaaza khola. Jabke Abu Raafe uskey paas raat ki mehfil mein tha. Aur wo uskey baala khaanon mein tha. Phir jab us se mehfil waley chaley gaey to main uski taraf chadha aur main jab darwaaza kholta to apne aap par andar se band karta. Main ne kaha: Agar qaum ko mera pata chal gaya to wo mujh tak na pahunchengay yahan tak ke main use qatl karun. To main us tak pahuncha. Phir wo andhere ghar mein apne ghar walon key darmiyaan tha. Mujhey nahi maloom tha ke wo ghar mein kahaan hai. To main ne kaha: Ae Abu Raafe! Us ne kaha: Ye kaun hai? To main aawaaz ki taraf jhuka aur use talwaar se maara jabke main ghabraaya hua tha. To main ne kuchh faeda na diya. Aur wo cheekha. To main ghar se nikla aur thodi der thehra. Phir uskey paas daakhil hua aur main ne kaha: Ye aawaaz kaisi hai ae Abu Raafe? To us ne kaha: Tumhaari maan par afsos! Beshak ghar mein aadmi hai jis ne mujhey pehley talwaar se maara tha. Unhon-ne kaha: To main ne use maara jo use zakhmi kar gaya aur use qatl na kya. Phir main ne talwaar ki nok uskey pet mein rakkhi yahan tak ke wo uski peeth mein nikal gai. To main ne jaan liya ke main ne use qatl kar diya hai. To main darwaazay kholney laga darwaaza darwaaza yahan tak ke main uski seedhi tak pahuncha. To main ne apna paon rakkha jabke main samajhta tha ke main zameen tak pahunch chuka hun. To main chaandni raat mein gira aur meri pindli toot gai. To main ne use amaamay se baandha. Phir chala yahan tak ke darwaazey par baitha aur main ne kaha: Main aaj raat na niklunga yahan tak ke main jaan lun ke main ne use qatl kya. Phir jab murgh ne baang di to pukaarne wala deewar par khada hua aur us ne kaha: Main Abu Raafe Hijaaz walon key taajir ki khabar deta hun. To main apne saathiyon ki taraf chala aur main ne kaha: Najaat! Beshak Allah ne Abu Raafe ko qatl kar diya hai. To main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas pahuncha aur Aap ko bayan kya. To Aap ne farmaya: Apna paon phailaao. To main ne apna paon phailaaya aur Aap ne use mala. To goya main ne kabhi uski shikaayat nahi ki thi. (Bukhari: 4039). Uhad ka ghazwa."
"1618","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Uhad key din aik aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha: Bataaiye agar main qatl kya jaaun to main kahaan hun? Aap ne farmaya: Jannat mein. To us ne apne haath mein khajoorein phenk deen, phir lada yahan tak ke qatl kya gaya. (Bukhari: 4046)"
"1619","[AI-translation] Saad bin Abi Waqqaas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Uhad key din dekha jabke Aap key sath do aadmi Aapki taraf se lad rahey they jabke un par safed kapdey they, sakht ladai jaisi. Main ne unhey us se pehley aur na uskey baad dekha. (Bukhari: 4054)"
"1620","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Saad Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne merey liye Uhad key din apna tarqash bicha diya aur farmaya: Teer chalaao, tum par merey maan baap qurbaan! (Bukhari: 4055)"
"1621","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Uhad key din zakhmi huey. To Aap ne farmaya: Qaum kaisey kaamyaab hogi jis ne apne Nabi ko zakhmi kya. To naazil hui: (Tumhaara muamley mein kuchh nahi). (Bukhari: 4069)"
"1622","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko suna jab Aap Fajr ki aakhri rakat key rukoo se apna sar uthaatey to farmaatey: Ae Allah! Fulaan aur fulaan aur fulaan par laanat farma! Uskey baad jo Aap kehtey: Allah ne uski sun li jo uski hamd karta hai. Ae hamaarey Rab! Aur teri hamd hai. To Allah ne naazil farmaya: (Tumhaara muamley mein kuchh nahi, ya wo un par tauba karey ya unhey azaab dey, beshak wo zaalim hain). (Bukhari: 4070). Hamza bin Abdul Muttalib (Raziallahu anhu) ka qatl."
"1623","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Adi bin Khiyaar se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Wahshi se kaha: Kya tum hamein Hamza key qatl ki khabar na dogey? Us ne kaha: Haan. Beshak Hamza ne Badr mein Tuaima bin Adi bin Khiyaar ko qatl kya tha. To merey aaqa Jubair bin Mutim ne mujh se kaha: Agar tum Hamza ko merey chacha key badley qatl karo to tum aazaad ho. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir jab log Ainain key saal nikley. Aur Ainain Uhad key saamney pahaad hai, uskey aur uskey darmiyaan waadi hai. To main logon key sath ladai key liye nikla. Phir jab wo ladai key liye safein baandh chukey to Sibaa nikla aur us ne kaha: Kya muqaabla karney wala hai? Unhon-ne kaha: To uski taraf Hamza bin Abdul Muttalib nikley. To unhon-ne kaha: Ae Sibaa! Ae Umm Anmaar key betey jo khaalon ko kaat-ti hai! Kya tum Allah aur uskey Rasool ki mukhaalifat kartey ho? Unhon-ne kaha: Phir us par hamla kya aur wo kal guzrey jaisa ho gaya. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur main Hamza key liye patthar key neechey chhupa. Phir jab wo mujh se qareeb hua to main ne use apna nezah maara. To main ne use uski naaf mein rakkha yahan tak ke wo uski raanon key darmiyaan se nikla. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo us se aakhri mulaqaat thi. Phir jab log wapas aey to main unkey sath wapas aaya. To main Makkah mein thehra yahan tak ke us mein Islam phail gaya. Phir main Taaef ki taraf nikla. To unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf bhejaney wala bheja. To mujh se kaha gaya: Beshak wo bhejaney walon ko na chhedta hai. Unhon-ne kaha: To main unkey sath nikla yahan tak ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya. Phir jab Aap ne mujhey dekha to Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum Wahshi ho? Main ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne Hamza ko qatl kya? Main ne kaha: Muamley mein jo tha wo tumhey pahunch chuka hai. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum taaqat rakhtey ho ke apna chehra mujh se ghaaeb karo? Unhon-ne kaha: To main nikla. Phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) faut ho gaey aur Musailima Kazzaab nikla to main ne kaha: Main zaroor Musailima ki taraf niklunga. Shayed main use qatl karun aur uskey sath Hamza ka badla lun. Unhon-ne kaha: To main logon key sath nikla aur uska jo muamla tha hua. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir aadmi deewar key shagaaf mein khada tha goya sabz oont bikhrey baalon wala. Unhon-ne kaha: To main ne use apna nezah maara. To main ne use uskey seeney key darmiyaan rakkha yahan tak ke wo uskey kandhon key darmiyaan se nikla. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur Ansaar mein se aadmi uski taraf kooda aur us ne usey sar par talwaar maari. (Bukhari: 4072)"
"1624","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ka ghussa qaum par sakht hua jinhon-ne apne Nabi key sath kya, Aapki daadh ki taraf ishaara kartey huey. Allah ka ghussa aadmi par sakht hua jise Rasulullah Allah key raastey mein qatl karein. (Bukhari: 4073)"
"1625","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko wo pahuncha jo Uhad key din pahuncha tha aur mushrikeen Aap se wapas aey to Aap ko khauf hua ke wo wapas aaeengey. Aap ne farmaya: Kaun unkey peechey jaaeyga? To un mein se sattar aadmi tayyaar huey. Unhon-ne kaha: Un mein Abu Bakr aur Zubair (Raziallahu anhuma) they. (Bukhari: 4077). Khabbaab bin Arat (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath hijrat ki jabke ham Allah ka chehra chaaahtey they. To hamaara ajr Allah par waaqe hua. To ham mein se koi guzra jis ne apne ajr mein se kuchh nahi liya. Un mein Musab bin Umair they jo Uhad key din qatl kiye gaey aur unhon-ne dhaaridaar chaadar chhori. Ham jab uskey sath uska sar dhaanptey to uskey paon zaahir hotey. Aur jab uskey paon dhaanptey to uska sar zaahir hota. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein hukm diya ke ham uska sar dhaanpen aur uskey pairon par izkhir mein se kuchh rakkhein. Aur ham mein se koi hai jiska phal pak gaya hai aur wo use kaat ta hai. (4082). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai. Urwa bin Zubair se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Beir Mauna waley qatl kiye gaey aur Amr bin Umayya Zamri qaidi banaaya gaya to Aamir bin Tufail ne us se kaha: Ye kaun hai? To us ne maqtool ki taraf ishaara kya. To Amr bin Umayya ne us se kaha: Ye Aamir bin Fuhaira hai. To us ne kaha: Main ne use qatl honay key baad aasmaan ki taraf uthaaya hua dekha yahan tak ke main aasmaan ki taraf dekhta hun uskey aur zameen key darmiyaan, phir wo rakkha gaya. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas unki khabar aai aur Aap ne unka sog manaaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak tumhaarey sahaaba zakhmi huey hain. Aur beshak unhon-ne apne Rab se maanga aur unhon-ne kaha: Ae hamaarey Rab! Hamaarey bhaiyon ko hamaari taraf se khabar dey ke ham tum se raazi hain aur tum ham se raazi ho. To unhey unki taraf se khabar di. Aur us din un mein Urwa bin Asma bin Salt zakhmi hua. To uskey naam par Urwa naam rakkha gaya. Aur Munzir bin Amr jiskey naam par Munzir naam rakkha gaya. (4093). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai. Khandaq ka ghazwa jo Ahzaab hai."
"1626","[AI-translation] Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak ham Khandaq key din khod rahey they aur sakht chattaan aa gai. To wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey aur unhon-ne kaha: Ye chattaan Khandaq mein aa gai hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Main utarta hun. Phir Aap uthay jabke Aapka pet patthar se baandha hua tha. Aur ham teen din thehrey aur maza na chakha. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kuddal liya aur chattaan ko maara. To wo ret ka teela ho gaya. (Bukhari: 4101)"
"1627","[AI-translation] Sulaimaan bin Surad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ahzaab key din farmaya: Ham un par ghazwa karengey aur wo ham par ghazwa na karengey. (Bukhari: 4109)"
"1628","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmaatey they: Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi, Wo Akela hai. Us ne apne lashkar ko izzat di. Aur apne bandey ki madad ki. Aur girohon par Akela ghaalib aaya. To uskey baad kuchh nahi hai. (Bukhari: 4114)"
"1629","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, wo kehtey hain: Quraiza waley Saad bin Muaz key faisley par utrey. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Saad ki taraf bheja aur wo gadhey par aey. Phir jab wo masjid key qareeb huey to Ansaar se farmaya: Apne sardaar ki taraf utho. Phir farmaya: Ye tumhaarey faisley par utrey hain. To unhon-ne kaha: Unkey ladney walon ko qatl karo aur unki aulaad ko qaidi banao. Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne Allah Azza wa Jall key hukm key sath faisla kya. Aur baaz auqaat farmaya: Baadshah key hukm key sath. (Bukhari: 4121). Zaat-ur-Riqa ka ghazwa."
"1630","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne saatween ghazwe, Zaat-ur-Riqa key ghazwe mein khauf ki namaz apne sahaaba ko padhaai. (Bukhari: 4127)"
"1631","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath ghazwe mein nikley jabke ham chhe aadmi they, hamaarey darmiyaan oont tha jis par ham baari baari sawaar hotey they. To hamaarey paon zakhmi ho gaey. Aur merey donon paon zakhmi ho gaey aur merey naakhun gir gaey. Aur ham apne pairon par kapdey lapet tey they. To use Zaat-ur-Riqa ka ghazwa kaha gaya jo ham apne pairon par kapdey baandhtey they. (Bukhari: 4128)"
"1632","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Abi Hasma (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, aur wo un mein they jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Zaat-ur-Riqa key din haazir huey they, unhon-ne khauf ki namaz padhi: Ke giroh Aap key sath saf mein tha. Aur giroh dushman key saamney tha. To Aap ne unkey sath jo Aap key sath they rakat padhi. Phir khadey rahey. Aur unhon-ne apne liye poori ki, phir wapas aey aur dushman key saamney saf mein aey. Aur doosra giroh aaya aur Aap ne unhey wo rakat padhaai jo Aapki namaz mein se baaqi thi. Phir baithey rahey. Aur unhon-ne apne liye poori ki. Phir unhey salaam kya. (Bukhari: 4130)"
"1633","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Najd ki taraf ghazwe mein gaey. Phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wapas aey to wo Aap key sath wapas aey. To unhey dopahar key aaraam ne waadi mein paa liya jo keekar se bhari thi. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) utrey aur log keekar mein juda ho gaey jo darkhton se saaya letey they. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) keekar key darkht key neechey utrey aur us par apni talwaar latkaai. Jaabir ne kaha: To ham soey, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamein bulaatey hain. To ham Aap key paas aey aur Aap key paas dehaati baitha tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak ye meri talwaar kheench kar nikla jab main soya hua tha. To main jaaga jabke wo uskey haath mein khuli thi. To us ne mujh se kaha: Tumhey mujh se kaun bachaayega? Main ne kaha: Allah! To wo yahaan baitha hai. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use saza na di. (Bukhari: 4135). Bani Mustaliq ka ghazwa jo Muraisi ka ghazwa hai."
"1634","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Bani Mustaliq key ghazwe mein nikley. To ham Arab key qaidiyon mein se qaidi paaey. To ham ne auraton ki khwaahish ki aur ham par ghair shaadi shuda rehna sakht hua aur ham ne azl ko pasand kya. To ham ne chaaha ke ham azl karein. Aur ham ne kaha ham azl kartey hain jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamaarey darmiyaan hain us se pehley ke ham Aap se poochhein. To ham ne Aap se uskey baarey mein poochha. To Aap ne farmaya: Tum par nahi hai ke tum na karo. Qiyaamat key din tak honay wali koi jaan nahi magar wo honay wali hai. (Bukhari: 4138). Anmaar ka ghazwa."
"1635","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah Ansaari (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Anmaar key ghazwe mein apni sawaari par mashriq ki taraf mutawajjeh ho kar nafl padhtey huey dekha. (Bukhari: 4140). Hudaibiya ka ghazwa aur Allah Taala ka qaul ke beshak Allah mominon se raazi hua jab wo darkht key neechey tumhaari baiat kar rahey they."
"1636","[AI-translation] Bara (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Tum fatah Makkah ki fatah shumaar kartey ho. Jabke Makkah ki fatah fatah thi. Aur ham fatah Baiat-ur-Rizwaan ko shumaar kartey hain Hudaibiya key din. Ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath chaudah sau they. Aur Hudaibiya kuwaan hai. To ham ne use khaali kar diya aur us mein qatra na chhora. To wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko pahunchi. To Aap uskey paas aey aur uskey kinarey par baithey. Phir Aap ne paani ka bartan maanga aur wuzu kya, phir kulli ki aur dua ki. Phir use us mein daala. To ham ne use thodi der chhora. Phir us ne hamein jitna ham chaaahtey they ham aur hamaari sawaariyaan seeraab kya. (Bukhari: 4150). Bara bin Aazib (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Hudaibiya key din aik hazaar chaar sau ya zyada they. To wo kuwein par utrey aur use khaali kar diya. To wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey. To Aap kuwein key paas aey aur uskey kinarey par baithey, phir farmaya: Mujhey uskey paani ka dol laao. To Aap key paas laaya gaya. To Aap ne thooka aur dua ki, phir farmaya: Use ghadi bhar chhoro. To unhon-ne apne aap aur apni sawaariyon ko seeraab kya yahan tak ke kooch kar gaey. (4151). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"1637","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham se Hudaibiya key din farmaya: Tum zameen walon mein sab se behtar ho. Jabke ham aik hazaar chaar sau they. Aur kaash main aaj dekhta to tumhey darkht ki jagah dikhaata. (Bukhari: 4155)"
"1638","[AI-translation] Suwaid bin Noman se riwayat hai, aur wo darkht walon mein se they, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Aap key sahaaba ke paas sattu laaya gaya aur unhon-ne use choosta. (Bukhari: 4175)"
"1639","[AI-translation] Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath raat ko chal rahey they. To Umar bin Khattab ne Aap se cheez key baarey mein poochha aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use jawaab na diya. Phir us ne poochha aur use jawaab na diya. Phir us ne poochha aur use jawaab na diya. Aur Umar bin Khattab ne kaha: Tumhaari maan tumhey gum kar dey ae Umar! Tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko teen martaba ilhaah kya jabke wo tumhey jawaab nahi detey. Umar ne kaha: To main ne apna oont hilaaya. Phir main Musalmaanon key aagey badha aur mujhey khauf hua ke mujh mein Quran naazil ho. To main ne der na ki ke pukaarne waley ko suna jo mujhey pukaarta hai. Unhon-ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Beshak mujhey khauf hua ke mujh mein Quran naazil hua hai. Aur main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur Aap ko salaam kya. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak aaj raat mujh par surat naazil hui hai jo mujhey us se zyada mehboob hai jis par sooraj nikla hai. Phir Aap ne padha: (Beshak ham ne tumhaarey liye wazeh fatah kholi). (Bukhari: 4177)"
"1640","[AI-translation] Miswar bin Makhrama se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Hudaibiya key saal mein apne sahaaba mein se pandrah sau mein nikley. Phir jab Aap Zul Hulaifa mein aey to qurbaani ko haar pehnaaya aur nishaan lagaaya aur us mein se Umrah ka ehraam baandha. Aur Khuzaa mein se apna jasus bheja. Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chaley yahan tak ke Aap Ghadeer-us-Ash taat mein they ke Aap key paas Aapka jasus aaya. Us ne kaha: Beshak Quraish ne tumhaarey liye giroh jama kiye hain. Aur unhon-ne tumhaarey liye Ahabish jama kiye hain. Aur wo tum se ladengey aur tumhey Bait se rokengey aur tumhey rokengey. To Aap ne farmaya: Mashwara do ae logon mujh par! Tumhaari kya raey hai ke main unkey ghar walon aur unki aulaad ki taraf maail hun jo hamein Bait se rokna chaaahtey hain. Phir agar wo hamaarey paas aaein to Allah ne mushrikeen mein se aankh kaat di hogi. Warna ham unhey loota hua chhorein. Abu Bakr ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Tum is Bait ka iraada kar key nikley ho. Tum kisi ko qatl karna nahi chaaahtey aur na kisi se ladna. To uski taraf mutawajjeh ho. Phir jo hamein us se rokega ham us se ladengey. Aap ne farmaya: Allah key naam par chalo! (Bukhari: 4179)"
"1641","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke uskey waalid ne use Hudaibiya key din bheja taake wo uskey paas ghoda laaey jo Ansaar mein se aadmi key paas tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko paaya jo darkht key paas baiat ley rahey they jabke Umar usey nahi jaantey they. To Abdullah ne Aapki baiat ki. Phir ghodey ki taraf gaey aur use Umar key paas laaey jabke Umar ladai key liye hathiyaar pehen rahey they. To unhey khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) darkht key neechey baiat ley rahey hain. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo chaley aur uskey sath gaey yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki baiat ki. To wahi hai jiskay baarey mein log baat kartey hain ke Ibn Umar apne waalid se pehley Musalman huey. (Bukhari: 4186)"
"1642","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abi Aufa (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath they jab Aap ne Umrah kya. To Aap ne tawaaf kya aur ham ne Aap key sath tawaaf kya. Aur Aap ne namaz padhi aur ham ne Aap key sath namaz padhi. Aur Safa aur Marwa key darmiyaan sayi ki. To ham Aap ko Makkah walon se dhaanptey they ke Aap ko koi cheez na pahunchey. (Bukhari: 4188). Zu Qarad ka ghazwa."

"1643","[AI-translation] Salma bin Akwa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main pehli azaan se pehley nikla jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki doodh waley oontniyaan Zu Qarad mein char rahi thein. Unhon-ne kaha: To mujhey Abdur Rahman bin Auf ka ladka mila. To us ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki doodh waley oontniyaan pakad li gaein. To hadees lambai key sath zikr ki aur wo guzar chuki hai. Aur yahaan uskey aakhir mein kaha, unhon-ne kaha: Phir ham wapas aey jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mujhey apni oontni par apne peechey sawaar kar rahey they yahan tak ke ham Madina mein daakhil huey. (Bukhari: 4194). Khaibar ka ghazwa."
"1644","[AI-translation] Salma bin Akwa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Khaibar ki taraf nikley aur ham raat ko chaley. To qaum mein se aadmi ne Aamir se kaha: Ae Aamir! Kya tum hamein apni chhoti cheezon mein se na sunaaogey? Jabke Aamir shaaer aadmi they. To wo utrey aur qaum ko hadee sunaatey huey kehtey: Ae Allah! Agar tu na hota to ham hidaayat na paatey aur na sadqa kartey aur na namaz padhtey. To maaf farma, tum par qurbaan, jo ham ne baaqi rakkha. Aur qadmon ko saabit rakkh agar ham milain. Aur ham par sukoon daal. Beshak ham jab pukaarey jaatey hain to aatey hain. Aur cheekh se ham par bharosa kya gaya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ye chalaaney wala kaun hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Aamir bin Akwa. Aap ne farmaya: Allah us par rehem farmaaey! Qaum mein se aadmi ne kaha: Waajib ho gai ae Allah key Nabi! Kaash tum hamein us se faeda detey! To ham Khaibar aey aur unka muhaasra kya yahan tak ke hamein sakht bhook lagi. Phir Allah Taala ne use un par fatah kya. Phir jab log us din ki shaam mein shaam huey jis mein wo un par fatah hui to unhon-ne bahut aagein jalaaein. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ye aagein kaisi hain? Tum kis cheez par jalaatey ho? Unhon-ne kaha: Gosht par. Aap ne farmaya: Kis gosht par? Unhon-ne kaha: Paaltu gadhon key gosht par. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use baha do aur unhey todo. To aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ham unhey baha dein aur unhey dho lein? Aap ne farmaya: Ya wo. Phir jab qaum safein baandh chuki to Aamir ki talwaar chhoti thi. To us ne us se Yahoodi ki pindli ko liya taake use maaray aur uski talwaar ki nok wapas aai. To wo Aamir key ghutney ki aankh par lagi aur wo us se mara. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir jab wo wapas aey to Salma ne kaha: Mujhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dekha jabke Aap mera haath pakdey huey they. Aap ne farmaya: Tumhey kya hua? Main ne us se kaha: Merey maan baap tum par qurbaan! Unka gumaan hai ke Aamir ka amal zaaya ho gaya hai. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne use kaha us ne jhoot kaha. Beshak uskey liye do ajr hain, aur Aap ne apni donon ungliyaan jama kein. Beshak wo koshish karney wala jihaad karney wala hai, kam Arab hain jo us jaisa chaley hon. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Uskey sath paida hua. (Bukhari: 4196)"
"1645","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Khaibar raat ko aey. Wo namaaz mein guzar chuki hai. Aur yahaan badhaa diya: To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ladney walon ko qatl kya aur aulaad ko qaidi banaaya. (Bukhari: 4197)"
"1646","[AI-translation] Abu Musa Ashaari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Khaibar ka ghazwa kya to log waadi par zaahir huey. To unhon-ne takbeer se apni aawaazein buland kein: Allahu Akbar! Allahu Akbar! Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne aap par narmi karo. Beshak tum behrey aur ghaaeb ko nahi pukaartey. Beshak tum Sun-ney waley Qareeb ko pukaartey ho jabke wo tumharey sath hai. Aur main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sawaari key peechey tha. To Aap ne mujhey suna jabke main kehta tha: Allah key siwa na taaqat aur na quwwat! To Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Ae Abdullah bin Qais! Main ne kaha: Haaazir hun Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Kya main tumhey Jannat key khazaanon mein se khazaaney key kalimat ki raah na dikhaaun? Main ne kaha: Kyun nahi Ya Rasulullah! Merey maan baap tum par qurbaan! Aap ne farmaya: Allah key siwa na taaqat aur na quwwat! (Bukhari: 4205)"
"1647","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Saad Saaedi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur mushrikeen milay aur ladey. Phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne lashkar ki taraf maail huey aur doosrey apne lashkar ki taraf maail huey. Jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sahaaba mein aadmi tha jo unkey liye chhoti badi cheez nahi chhorta magar usey apni talwaar se maarney key liye uskey peechey jaata. To kaha gaya: Ham mein se aaj kisi ne itna kaam nahi kya jitna fulaan ne kya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khabardaar! Beshak wo aag walon mein se hai. To qaum mein se aadmi ne kaha: Main uska saathi hun. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo uskey sath nikla. Jab wo rukta to wo uskey sath rukta. Aur jab wo tez chalta to wo uskey sath tez chalta. Unhon-ne kaha: To aadmi sakht zakhmi hua. To us ne maut mein jaldi ki aur apni talwaar zameen par rakkhi aur uski nok apne seeney key darmiyaan. Phir apni talwaar par zor laga kar apne aap ko qatl kar liya. To aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf nikla aur us ne kaha: Main gawahi deta hun ke tum Allah key Rasool ho. Aap ne farmaya: Aur wo kya hai? Us ne kaha: Wo aadmi jiska tum ne abhi zikr kya ke wo aag walon mein se hai. To logon ne use bada samjha. To main ne kaha: Main tumhaarey liye uskey sath hun. To main uski talaash mein nikla. Phir wo sakht zakhmi hua. To us ne maut mein jaldi ki. To us ne apni talwaar ki nok zameen mein rakkhi aur uski nok apne seeney key darmiyaan, phir us par zor laga kar apne aap ko qatl kar liya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us waqt farmaya: Beshak aadmi Jannat walon key amal karta hai jo logon ko zaahir hota hai jabke wo aag walon mein se hai. Aur beshak aadmi aag walon key amal karta hai jo logon ko zaahir hota hai jabke wo Jannat walon mein se hai. (Bukhari: 4207)"
"1648","[AI-translation] Aur aik riwayat mein hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jannat mein momin key siwa daakhil na hoga. Beshak Allah deen ki faasiq aadmi key sath taeed karta hai. (Bukhari: 4203)"
"1649","[AI-translation] Salma bin Akwa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Mujhey Khaibar key din meri pindli mein maar lagi. To main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya. To Aap ne us mein teen martaba phoonka. To main ne uski ab tak shikaayat nahi ki. (Bukhari: 4206)"
"1650","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Khaibar aur Madina key darmiyaan teen raatein thehrey jab Aap ne Safiya se nikaah kya. To main ne Musalmaanon ko Aap key waleemay ki taraf bulaaya. Aur us mein roti aur na gosht tha. Aur us mein sirf ye tha ke Aap ne Bilaal ko dastarkhwanon ka hukm diya aur wo bichaaye gaey. To Aap ne un par khajoor aur paneer aur ghee rakkha. To Musalmaanon ne kaha: Ummahaat-ul-Momineen mein se aik ya jo Aapkey daaen haath ki milkiyat mein hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Agar Aap ne unhey pardey mein kya to wo Ummahaat-ul-Momineen mein se aik hain. Aur agar Aap ne unhey pardey mein na kya to wo us mein se hain jo Aapkey daaen haath ki milkiyat mein hai. Phir jab Aap kooch kar gaey to Aap ne unkey liye apne peechey jagah banai aur parda latka diya. (Bukhari: 4213)"
"1651","[AI-translation] Ali bin Abi Taalib (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Khaibar key din auraton se muta aur paaltu gadhon key gosht khaaney se mana kya. (Bukhari: 4216)"
"1652","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Khaibar key din ghodey key liye do hissey aur paidal key liye hissa taqseem kya. (Bukhari: 4228)"
"1653","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Hamein Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key nikalney ki khabar pahunchi jabke ham Yaman mein they. To ham Aapki taraf hijrat kar key nikley, main aur merey do bhai jabke main un mein sab se chhota hun. Un mein aik Abu Burda aur doosra Abu Ruhm. Meri qaum mein se tirpan mein. To ham kashti mein sawaar huey. To hamaari kashti ne hamein Habsha mein Najaashi key paas daal diya. To ham Jafar bin Abi Taalib se jaa milay. To ham unkey sath thehrey yahan tak ke ham sab aey. To ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se jaa milay jab Aap ne Khaibar fatah kya tha. Aur logon mein se log ham se kehtey they, yaani kashti walon se: Ham tum se hijrat mein sabqat ley gaey. Aur Asma bint Umais, aur wo un mein thein jo hamaarey sath aaein thein, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi Hafsa key paas mulaqaat key liye daakhil huin. Jabke wo Najaashi ki taraf hijrat kar chuki thein un mein jo hijrat kar chukey they. To Umar Hafsa key paas daakhil huey jabke Asma unkey paas thein. To Umar ne jab Asma ko dekha to kaha: Ye kaun hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Asma bint Umais. Umar ne kaha: Ye Habshiya, ye samandari? Asma ne kaha: Haan. Unhon-ne kaha: Ham tum se hijrat mein sabqat ley gaey. To ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key tum se zyada haqdaar hain. To wo ghussa huin aur unhon-ne kaha: Hargiz nahi, Allah ki qasam! Tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath they jo tumhaarey bhookay ko khilata tha aur tumhaarey jaahil ko nasihat karta tha. Aur ham door dushmanon key ghar ya zameen mein Habsha mein they. Aur wo Allah aur uskey Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key liye tha. Aur Allah ki qasam! Main khaana na khaaungi aur na peena piyungi yahan tak ke main jo tum ne kaha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko yaad karun. Aur ham takleef diye jaatey they aur daraaye jaatey they. Aur main wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko yaad karungi aur Aap se poochhungi. Aur Allah ki qasam main jhoot na bolungi aur na tedhi hungi aur na us par badhaaungi. Phir jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashreef laaey to unhon-ne kaha: Ae Allah key Nabi! Beshak Umar ne aisa aisa kaha. Aap ne farmaya: To tum ne us se kya kaha? Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne us se aisa aisa kaha. Aap ne farmaya: Wo tum se mujh se zyada haqdaar nahi hai. Aur usey aur uskey sahaaba ko aik hijrat hai. Aur tumhey, ae kashti walon, do hijratein hain. (Bukhari: 4230, 4231)"
"1654","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Musa Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak main Ashaariyon key qaafiley ki Quran se aawaazon ko pehchaanta hun jab wo raat ko daakhil hotey hain. Aur main unkey thikaanon ko raat ko Quran se unki aawaazon se pehchaanta hun. Agarchey main ne unkey thikaanon ko nahi dekha jab wo din mein utrey. Aur un mein daana hai jab wo ghodon se milta hai. Ya farmaya: Dushman se. Wo un se kehta hai: Beshak merey sahaaba tumhey hukm detey hain ke tum unhey mohlat do. (Bukhari: 4232)"
"1655","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Musa Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey uskey baad ke Aap ne Khaibar fatah kya tha. To Aap ne hamaarey liye taqseem kya aur hamaarey siwa kisi key liye taqseem nahi kya jo fatah mein haazir na hua tha. (Bukhari: 4233). Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Aap key sahaaba tashreef laaey. To mushrikeen ne kaha: Beshak tumharey paas wafd aaeyga jise Yasrib ka bukhaar kamzor kar chuka hai. Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhey hukm diya ke wo teen chakron mein dauden aur donon ruknon key darmiyaan chalen. Aur Aap ko unhey hukm deney se sirf un par rehem ne mana kya ke wo tamaam chakron mein dauden. Abu Abdullah ne kaha: Aur Ibn Salma ne Ayyub se, Saeed bin Jubair se, Ibn Abbas se badhaa diya, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne saal mein tashreef laaey jismein Aap ne aman paai thi to farmaya: Daudo! Taake mushrikeen tumhaari quwwat dekhein. Jabke mushrikeen Quaiqiaan ki taraf se they. (4256). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"1656","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Maimoona se nikaah kya jab Aap ehraam mein they. Aur un se nikaah kya jab Aap halaal they. Aur wo Sarif mein faut huin. (Bukhari: 4258). Shaam ki zameen mein Mauta ka ghazwa."
"1657","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Mauta key ghazwe mein Zaid bin Haaritha ko muqarrar kya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar Zaid qatl kya gaya to Jafar. Aur agar Jafar qatl kya gaya to Abdullah bin Rawaaha. Abdullah ne kaha: Main un mein tha us ghazwe mein. To ham ne Jafar bin Abi Taalib ko talaash kya aur unhey maqtoolon mein paaya. Aur ham ne unkey jism mein nabbe se zyada nezey aur teer key zakhm paaey. (Bukhari: 4261)"
"1658","[AI-translation] Usaama bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, wo kehtey hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein Huraqa ki taraf bheja. To ham ne subah qaum par hamla kya aur unhey shikast di. Aur main aur Ansaar mein se aadmi un mein se aadmi key peechey lagey. Phir jab ham ne use gher liya to us ne kaha: Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi! To Ansaari ruk gaya aur main ne use apne nezeh se maara yahan tak ke use qatl kar diya. Phir jab ham aey to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko pahunchi. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Usaama! Kya tum ne use uskey (Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi) kehney key baad qatl kya? Main ne kaha: Wo panaah maangta tha. To Aap use dohraatey rahey yahan tak ke main ne tamanna ki ke main us din se pehley Musalman na hua hota. (Bukhari: 4269)"
"1659","[AI-translation] Salma bin Akwa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath saat ghazwe kiye. Aur main un mein nikla jo Aap bhejtey they, nau ghazwe. Aik martaba ham par Abu Bakr they. Aur aik martaba ham par Usaama they. (Bukhari: 4271). Ramazan mein Fatah ka ghazwa."
"1660","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Ramazan mein Madina se nikley jabke Aap key sath das hazaar they. Aur wo Aap key Madina aamad key aath saal aur nisf par tha. To Aap aur Aap key sath Musalman Makkah ki taraf chaley jabke Aap roza rakhtey aur wo roza rakhtey. Yahan tak ke Aap Kadeed tak pahunchay. Aur wo Usfaan aur Qudaid key darmiyaan paani hai. To Aap ne iftaar kya aur unhon-ne iftaar kya. (Bukhari: 4276)"
"1661","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Ramazan mein Hunain ki taraf nikley jabke log ikhtelaaf kartey they. Rozeydaar aur iftaar karnay walay. Phir jab Aap apni sawaari par baraabar huey to doodh ya paani ka bartan maanga aur use apni hatheli par, ya apni sawaari par, rakkha. Phir logon ki taraf dekha. To iftaar walon ne rozey walon se kaha: Iftaar karo. (Bukhari: 4277)"
"1662","[AI-translation] Urwa bin Zubair se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Fatah key saal chaley aur wo Quraish ko pahunchi to Abu Sufyan bin Harb aur Hakeem bin Hizaam aur Budail bin Warqa Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khabar talaash karney nikley. To wo chaltey huey aey yahan tak ke Marr-uz-Zahraan mein aey. Phir wo aagon key paas they goya Arafah ki aagein hain. To Abu Sufyan ne kaha: Ye kya hain, goya Arafah ki aagein hain? To Budail bin Warqa ne kaha: Bani Amr ki aagein. To Abu Sufyan ne kaha: Amr us se kam hai. To unhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key pehrey mein se logon ne dekha aur unhey paa liya aur pakad liya. To wo unhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas laaey. To Abu Sufyan Musalman ho gaya. Phir jab Aap chaley to Aap ne Abbas se farmaya: Abu Sufyan ko pahaad key tootney key paas rok rakkho yahan tak ke wo Musalmaanon ko dekhey. To Abbas ne use rok rakkha. To qabeelay Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath guzarney lagey, dasta dasta Abu Sufyan par se guzartey. To dasta guzra. Us ne kaha: Ae Abbas ye kaun hain? Unhon-ne kaha: Ye Gifaar hain. Us ne kaha: Mujhey Gifaar se kya kaam. Phir Juhaina guzri. Us ne waisa kaha. Phir Saad bin Huzaim guzri. To us ne waisa kaha. Aur Saleem guzri. To us ne waisa kaha. Yahan tak ke dasta aaya jo us ne us jaisa na dekha tha. Us ne kaha: Ye kaun hain? Unhon-ne kaha: Ye Ansaar hain, un par Saad bin Ubaada hain jabke uskey sath jhanda hai. To Saad bin Ubaada ne kaha: Ae Abu Sufyan! Aaj ladai ka din hai. Aaj Kaaba halaal kya jaaeyga. To Abu Sufyan ne kaha: Ae Abbas kya hi achha badley ka din hai! Phir dasta aaya jabke wo daston mein sab se chhota tha jismein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Aap key sahaaba they. Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka jhanda Zubair bin Awwaam key sath tha. Phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Abu Sufyan key paas se guzrey to unhon-ne kaha: Kya tum nahi jaantey jo Saad bin Ubaada ne kaha? Aap ne farmaya: Us ne kya kaha? Us ne kaha: Aisa aisa. To Aap ne farmaya: Saad ne jhoot kaha. Lekin ye din hai jismein Allah Kaaba ki taazeem karta hai aur din hai jismein Kaaba ko libaas pehnaaya jaaeyga. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hukm diya ke Aapka jhanda Hajoon mein gaada jaey. To Abbas ne Zubair bin Awwaam se kaha: Ae Abu Abdullah! Yahaan tumhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jhanda gaadney ka hukm diya tha. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us din Khaalid bin Waleed ko hukm diya ke wo Makkah key baalaai hissey se Kada se daakhil ho. Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Kuda se daakhil huey. To Khaalid bin Waleed (Raziallahu anhu) key sawaaron mein se us din do aadmi qatl kiye gaey: Hubaysh bin Ashar aur Karz bin Jaabir Fihri. (Bukhari: 4280)"
"1663","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Mughaffal (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, wo kehtey hain: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Makkah ki fatah key din apni oontni par dekha jabke Aap Surat-ul-Fatah padh rahey they aur dohrai kar rahey they. Aur farmaya: Kaash log merey gird jama na hotey to main dohrai karta jaisa Aap ne dohrai ki. (Bukhari: 4281)"
"1664","[AI-translation] Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Makkah mein Fatah key din daakhil huey jabke Bait key gird teen sau saath but they. To Aap unhey apne haath mein laathi se chubhonay lagey aur farmaatey: (Haq aaya aur baatil mit gaya). (Haq aaya aur baatil na shuru karta hai aur na wapas karta hai). (Bukhari: 4287)"
"1665","[AI-translation] Amr bin Salma (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham paani par they jo logon key guzarney ki jagah tha. Aur hamarey paas sawaar guzartey aur ham un se poochhtey: Logon ka kya haal hai, logon ka kya haal hai? Ye aadmi kaun hai? To wo kehtey: Wo gumaan karta hai ke Allah ne use bheja hai, us par wahi ki hai, ya Allah ne aisa wahi kya hai. To main wo baat yaad rakhta tha. Aur goya wo merey seeney mein bithaai jaati thi. Aur Arab apne Islam key sath Fatah ka intezaar kartey they. To wo kehtey: Use aur uski qaum ko chhoro. Beshak agar wo un par ghaalib aaey to wo sacha Nabi hai. Phir jab Fatah walon ki ladai hui to har qaum apne Islam key sath daudi. Aur merey waalid apni qaum key Islam key sath dauday. Phir jab wo aey to unhon-ne kaha: Main tumharey paas Allah ki qasam Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas se haq key sath aaya hun. To us ne farmaya: Fulaan namaz fulaan waqt mein padho. Aur fulaan namaz fulaan waqt mein padho. Phir jab namaz haazir ho to tum mein se koi azaan dey aur tumhey tum mein sab se zyada Quran wala imaamat karaaey. To unhon-ne dekha aur mujh se zyada Quran wala koi na tha jo main sawaaron se leta tha. To unhon-ne mujhey apne aagey kar diya jabke main chhe ya saat saal ka tha. Aur mujh par chaadar thi jab main sajda karta to wo mujh se simat jaati. To qabeelay ki aurat ne kaha: Kya tum ham se apne qaari ki sharmgaah na dhaanpogey? To unhon-ne khareeda aur merey liye qameez kaat di. To main kisi cheez se itna khush nahi hua jitna us qameez se khush hua. (Bukhari: 4302)"
"1666","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abi Aufa se riwayat hai ke uskey haath mein maar thi. Unhon-ne kaha: Mujhey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Hunain key din maara gaya tha. (Bukhari: 4314). Autaas ka ghazwa."
"1667","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Hunain se faarigh huey to Aap ne Abu Aamir ko lashkar par Autaas ki taraf bheja. To wo Duraid bin Simma se milay. To Duraid qatl kya gaya aur Allah ne uskey saathiyon ko shikast di. Abu Musa ne kaha: Aur mujhey Abu Aamir key sath bheja. To Abu Aamir uskey ghutney mein maara gaya. Use Jushami ne teer maara aur use uskey ghutney mein gaad diya. To main uskey paas pahuncha aur main ne kaha: Ae chacha! Tumhey kis ne maara? To us ne Abu Musa ki taraf ishaara kya. To us ne kaha: Wo mera qaatil hai jis ne mujhey maara. To main uskey liye qasad mein gaya aur usey paa liya. Phir jab us ne mujhey dekha to wapas aaya. To main uskey peechey aaya aur us se kehta raha: Kya tum sharm nahi kartey? Kya tum thehartey nahi? To wo ruka aur ham ne talwaar se do maarein ikhtelaaf kein aur main ne use qatl kar diya. Phir main ne Abu Aamir se kaha: Allah ne tumhaarey saathi ko qatl kar diya. Unhon-ne kaha: Ye teer nikaalo. To main ne use nikaala aur us se paani nikla. Unhon-ne kaha: Ae merey bhatijay! Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko salaam kehna aur us se kehna: Merey liye maghfirat maango. Aur Abu Aamir ne mujhey logon par khaleefa banaaya aur wo thodi der thehrey phir faut ho gaey. To main wapas aaya aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas Aap key ghar mein chaarpaai par daakhil hua jo rassiyon wali thi jabke us par bistar tha jiskey rassiyon key nishaan Aapki peeth aur Aap key pehlu par they. To main ne Aap ko hamaari aur Abu Aamir ki khabar di. Aur us ne kaha: Us se kaho: Merey liye maghfirat maango. To Aap ne paani maanga aur wuzu kya. Phir apney haath uthaaey aur farmaya: Ae Allah! Ubaid Abu Aamir ko maaf farma! Aur main ne Aapki baghlon ki safedi dekhi. Phir farmaya: Ae Allah! Use Qiyaamat key din terey makhlooq mein bahuton se upar kar! To main ne kaha: Aur merey liye maghfirat maango. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Abdullah bin Qais key gunaah ko maaf farma aur use Qiyaamat key din izzat waley daakhiley mein daakhil farma! (Bukhari: 4323). Shawwaal san aath mein Taaef ka ghazwa."

"1668","[AI-translation] Umm Salma (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) merey paas daakhil huey jabke merey paas mukhannas tha. To main ne use Abdullah bin Abi Umayya se kehtey huey suna: Ae Abdullah! Batao agar Allah kal tum par Taaef fatah karey? To tum par Ghailaan ki beti laazim hai. Beshak wo chaar se aati hai aur aath se jaati hai. Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ye tumharey paas daakhil na hon. (Bukhari: 4324)"
"1669","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Taaef ka muhaasra kya aur un se kuchh na paa sakay to Aap ne farmaya: Beshak ham wapas jaaney waley hain agar Allah ne chaaha. To un par giraan guzra. Aur unhon-ne kaha: Ham jaatey hain aur use fatah nahi kartey. Aur aik martaba farmaya: Ham wapas jaaengey. To Aap ne farmaya: Subah ladai par jao. To wo subah gaey aur unhey zakhm lagay. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak ham kal wapas jaaney waley hain agar Allah ne chaaha. To unhey achha laga aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hansay. (Bukhari: 4325)"
"1670","[AI-translation] Saad aur Abu Bakra (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo apne baap key siwa kisi ki taraf mansoob ho jabke wo jaanta ho to Jannat us par haraam hai. (Bukhari: 4326)"
"1671","[AI-translation] Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Lekin un mein se aik to pehla hai jis ne Allah key raastey mein teer chalaaya. Aur doosra Taaef key qile par logon mein chadha aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya. (Bukhari: 4327)"
"1672","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas tha jabke Aap Jiraana mein utrey huey they jo Makkah aur Madina key darmiyaan hai jabke Aap key sath Bilaal they. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas dehaati aaya. To us ne kaha: Kya tum merey liye wo poora na karogey jo tum ne mujh se waada kya tha? To Aap ne us se farmaya: Khushkhabri paao! To us ne kaha: Tum ne mujh par khushkhabri bahut ki hai. To Aap Abu Musa aur Bilaal ki taraf ghussay jaisey mutawajjeh huey aur farmaya: Us ne khushkhabri wapas kar di, to tum donon qabool karo. Unhon-ne kaha: Ham ne qabool ki. Phir Aap ne pyaala maanga jismein paani tha. To Aap ne us mein apney haath aur apna chehra dhoya aur us mein kulli ki. Phir farmaya: Us mein se piyo aur apne chehron aur apne seenon par daalo aur khushkhabri paao! To unhon-ne pyaala liya aur aisa kya. To Umm Salma ne pardey key peechey se pukaara ke apni maan key liye bachaao. To unhon-ne us mein se uskey liye tukda bachaaya. (Bukhari: 4328)"
"1673","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ansaar mein se logon ko jama kya. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Quraish jaahiliyat aur museebat se naya ahd rakhtay hain. Aur beshak main ne chaaha hai ke main unhey jodun aur unhey maanoos karun. Kya tum raazi nahi ho ke log duniya key sath wapas jaaein aur tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath apne gharon ki taraf wapas jao? Unhon-ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Agar log waadi mein chalen aur Ansaar ghaati mein chalen to main Ansaar ki waadi mein chalunga. Ya Ansaar ki ghaati mein. (Bukhari: 4334)"
"1674","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Khaalid bin Waleed ko Bani Jazeema ki taraf bheja. To unhon-ne unhey Islam ki daawat di aur wo achhi tarah na keh sakay: Ham Musalman huey. To wo kehney lagey: Ham deen badal gaey, ham deen badal gaey! To Khaalid un mein qatl aur qaidi banaane lagay. Aur ham mein se har aadmi ko uska qaidi diya. Yahan tak ke ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey aur Aap ko zikr kya. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apna haath uthaaya aur farmaya: Ae Allah! Beshak main teri taraf Khaalid key kiye se baraan hun! Do martaba. (Bukhari: 4339)"
"1675","[AI-translation] Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne lashkar bheja aur Ansaar mein se aadmi ko muqarrar kya aur unhey hukm diya ke uski itaat karein. To wo ghussa hua aur us ne kaha: Kya Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tumhey hukm nahi diya ke tum meri itaat karo? Unhon-ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Us ne kaha: To merey liye lakdiyaan jama karo. To unhon-ne jama kein. To us ne kaha: Aag jalaao. To unhon-ne jalaai. To us ne kaha: Us mein daakhil ho. To wo qasad karney lagey. Aur un mein se baaz baaz ko roktey aur kehtey: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf aag se bhaagay hain. To wo rahey yahan tak ke aag bujh gai. To uska ghussa thanda hua. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko pahunchi. To Aap ne farmaya: Agar wo us mein daakhil hotey to us mein se Qiyaamat key din tak na nikaltey. Itaat neki mein hai. (Bukhari: 4340)"
"1676","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use aur Muaz bin Jabal ko Yaman ki taraf bheja. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur un mein se har aik ko ziley par bheja. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur Yaman do ziley hain. Phir farmaya: Aasaani karo aur sakhti na karo. Aur khushkhabri do aur nafrat na dilaao. To un mein se har aik apne kaam ki taraf chala. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur un mein se har aik jab apni zameen mein chalta jab wo apne saathi key qareeb hota to uskey sath naya ahd karta aur use salaam karta. To Muaz apni zameen mein apne saathi Abu Musa key qareeb chaley. To wo apne khachchar par chaltey huey aey yahan tak ke us tak pahunchey. Jabke wo baitha tha aur log uskey paas jama they. Jabke uskey paas aadmi tha jiskay donon haath uski gardan se jodey gaey they. To Muaz ne us se kaha: Ae Abdullah bin Qais! Ye kaun hai? Us ne kaha: Ye aadmi hai jo apne Islam key baad kaafir hua. Us ne kaha: Main na utrunga yahan tak ke wo qatl kya jaey. Us ne kaha: Use isliye laaya gaya hai, to utro. Us ne kaha: Main na utrunga yahan tak ke wo qatl kya jaey. To uskey baarey mein hukm diya aur wo qatl kya gaya, phir utra. To us ne kaha: Ae Abdullah! Tum Quran kaisey padhtey ho? Us ne kaha: Main use waqfon se padhta hun. Us ne kaha: Aur tum ae Muaz kaisey padhtey ho? Us ne kaha: Main raat key awwal mein sota hun aur uthta hun jabke main ne apni neend ka hissa poora kar liya hota hai. To main padhta hun jo Allah ne merey liye likha hai. To main apni neend ka sawaab ginta hun jaisa apne qiyaam ka sawaab ginta hun. (Bukhari: 4342)"
"1677","[AI-translation] Abu Musa Ashaari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use Yaman ki taraf bheja. To us ne Aap se un sharb aton key baarey mein poochha jo wahaan banaaey jaatey hain. To Aap ne farmaya: Aur wo kya hain? Us ne kaha: Bit aur Mizr. To Aap ne farmaya: Har nashaa denay wala haraam hai. (Bukhari: 4343)"
"1678","[AI-translation] Bara (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein Khaalid bin Waleed key sath Yaman ki taraf bheja. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir uskey baad Ali ko uski jagah bheja. To farmaya: Khaalid key saathiyon ko hukm do ke un mein se jo chaahey tumharey sath peechey rahey to peechey rahey. Aur jo chaahey wapas aaey. To main un mein tha jo uskey sath peechey raha. Unhon-ne kaha: To main ne ginti key ooqiya ganeemat mein paaey. (Bukhari: 4349)"
"1679","[AI-translation] Buraida (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ali ko Khaalid ki taraf bheja taake khums qabz karey. Jabke main Ali se bugz rakhta tha. Aur wo ghusl kar chukey they. To main ne Khaalid se kaha: Kya tum isey nahi dekhtey? Phir jab ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey to main ne Aap ko uska zikr kya. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Buraida! Kya tum Ali se bugz rakhtey ho? To main ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Us se bugz na rakkho. Beshak uskey liye khums mein us se zyada hai. (Bukhari: 4350)"
"1680","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ali bin Abi Taalib (Raziallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf Yaman se sonay ki dali bheji jo chamdey mein thi jo dabaagh key patton se rangi gai thi jabke wo uski mitti se saaf nahi ki gai thi. Unhon-ne kaha: To Aap ne use chaar aadmiyon key darmiyaan taqseem kya: Uyaina bin Badr aur Aqra bin Haabis aur Zaid-ul-Khail key darmiyaan. Aur chautha ya Alqama ya Aamir bin Tufail. To Aap key sahaaba mein se aadmi ne kaha: Ham un se iskey zyada haqdaar they. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko pahunchi. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum mujh par aman nahi kartey jabke main uska ameen hun jo aasmaan mein hai. Merey paas aasmaan ki khabar subah aur shaam aati hai. Unhon-ne kaha: To dhansi huin aankhon wala, ubhrey gaalon wala, uthi huin peshaani wala, ghani daadhi wala, mundway sar wala, tehband uthaaye huey aadmi khada hua. To us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Allah se daro! Aap ne farmaya: Tum par afsos! Kya main zameen walon mein sab se zyada haqdaar nahi hun ke Allah se darun? Unhon-ne kaha: Phir aadmi wapas aaya. Khaalid bin Waleed ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya main uski gardan na maarun? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi. Shayed wo namaz padhta ho. To Khaalid ne kaha: Aur kitney namaz padhney waley hain jo apni zabaan se kehtey hain jo unkey dil mein nahi hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak mujhey hukm nahi diya gaya ke main logon key dilon ko khodun aur na unkey pet cheerun. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir Aap ne uski taraf dekha jabke wo peeth moray huey tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak iski nasal se qaum niklegi jo Allah ki Kitaab ko tar parhengey jo unkey halqon se aagey na badhegi. Wo deen se nikal jaaengey jaisa teer shikaar se nikal jaata hai. Aur mera khayaal hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak agar main unhey paaun to unhey Samood key qatl jaisa qatl karunga. (Bukhari: 4351). Zu Khalasa ka ghazwa."
"1681","[AI-translation] Jareer (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees uskey baarey mein guzar chuki hai aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka qaul: Kya tum mujhey Zu Khalasa se aaraam na dogey? Aur is riwayat mein Jareer ne kaha: Aur Zu Khalasa Yaman mein Khasam aur Bajila ka ghar tha jismein but they jo poojay jaatey they. Use Kaaba kaha jaata tha. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo uskey paas aaya aur use aag se jalaaya aur toda. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur jab Jareer Yaman aaya to wahaan aadmi tha jo teeron se qismat aazmaata tha. To us se kaha gaya: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka bhejaney wala yahaan hai. Phir agar wo tum par qaadir hua to tumhaari gardan maar dega. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir jabke wo unkey sath maar raha tha ke us par Jareer khada hua aur us ne kaha: Tum unhey zaroor todogey aur gawahi dogey ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi. Ya main tumhaari gardan maar dunga. Unhon-ne kaha: To us ne unhey toda aur gawahi di. (Bukhari: 4357)"
"1682","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Jareer Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Yaman mein tha. To main Yaman walon mein se do aadmiyon se mila: Zu Kalaa aur Zu Amr. To main unhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki hadees sunaane laga. To us se Zu Amr ne kaha: Beshak agar jo tum apne saathi key muamley mein zikr kartey ho to uski muddat teen se guzar chuki hai. Aur wo donon merey sath aey yahan tak ke jab ham raastey mein they to hamaarey liye Madina ki taraf se qaafila uthaaya gaya. To ham ne un se poochha. To unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) faut ho gaey hain aur Abu Bakr khaleefa banaaey gaey hain. Aur log nek hain. To unhon-ne kaha: Apne saathi ko khabar do ke ham aaey hain. Aur shayed ham wapas aaeengey agar Allah ne chaaha. Aur wo donon Yaman wapas aey. (Bukhari: 4359). Samandar key kinaarey ka ghazwa jab wo Quraish key qaafiley ka isteqbaal kar rahey they jabke unka ameer Abu Ubaida bin Jarraah tha."
"1683","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne samandar key kinaarey lashkar bheja aur un par Abu Ubaida bin Jarraah ko muqarrar kya. Jabke wo teen sau they. To ham nikley jabke ham raastey mein they ke tosha khatm ho gaya. To Abu Ubaida ne lashkar key toshon ka hukm diya aur wo jama kiye gaey. To wo khajoor key do thailay they. To wo hamein har din thoda thoda khilaata tha yahan tak ke khatm ho gaya. To hamein khajoor khajoor key siwa na milti thi. To main ne kaha: Tumhey khajoor kya faeda deti hai? To us ne kaha: Ham ne uski kami paai jab wo khatm hui. Phir ham samandar tak pahunchey. Phir machhli teelay jaisi thi. To qaum ne us mein se attharah raatein khaaya. Phir Abu Ubaida ne uski pasliyon mein se do pasliyon ka hukm diya aur wo nasb ki gaein. Phir us ne oontni ka hukm diya aur us par kajawa kasa gaya. Phir wo un donon key neechey se guzri aur unhey na lagi. (Bukhari: 4360)"
"1684","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Jaabir Raziallahu anhuma se) aik riwayat mein hai ke unhon-ne kaha: To hamarey liye samandar ne jaanwar daala jisey Anbar kaha jaata hai. To ham ne us mein se aadha mahina khaaya aur uski charbi se tel lagaaya yahan tak ke hamaarey jism hamaari taraf wapas aey. (Bukhari: 4361)"
"1685","[AI-translation] Aur aik doosri riwayat mein hai: To Abu Ubaida ne kaha: Khaao! Phir jab ham Madina aey to ham ne uska Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se zikr kya. To Aap ne farmaya: Khaao, wo rizq hai jo Allah ne nikaala hai. Hamein khilaao agar tumharey paas ho. To Aap key paas un mein se baaz aey aur Aap ne khaaya. (Bukhari: 4362). Bani Tameem ka wafd."
"1686","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Bani Tameem mein se sawaar Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey. To Abu Bakr ne kaha: Qaqaa bin Maabad bin Zuraara ko muqarrar karo. Umar ne kaha: Balke Aqra bin Haabis ko muqarrar karo. Abu Bakr ne kaha: Tum ne sirf meri mukhaalifat ka iraada kya. Umar ne kaha: Main ne tumhaari mukhaalifat ka iraada nahi kya. To wo donon jhagdey yahan tak ke un donon ki aawaazein buland huin. To uskey baarey mein naazil hui: (Ae imaan walon! Aagey na badho) yahan tak ke khatm hui. (Bukhari: 4367). Bani Haneefa ka wafd aur Sumaama bin Usa al ki hadees."
"1687","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Najd ki taraf sawaar bhejey. To wo Bani Haneefa mein se aadmi ley kar aey jisey Sumaama bin Usa al kaha jaata tha. To unhon-ne use masjid key sutoonon mein se sutoon se baandha. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uskey paas nikley aur farmaya: Ae Sumaama tumharey paas kya hai? To us ne kaha: Merey paas bhalai hai ae Muhammad! Agar tum mujhey qatl karo to khoon waley ko qatl karogey. Aur agar tum ehsaan karo to shukr guzaar par ehsaan karogey. Aur agar tum maal chaaahtey ho to us mein se jo chaaaho maango. To use chhora gaya yahan tak ke kal thi. Phir Aap ne us se farmaya: Ae Sumaama tumharey paas kya hai? Us ne kaha: Jo main ne tum se kaha: Agar tum ehsaan karo to shukr guzaar par ehsaan karogey. To use chhora yahan tak ke us se agla din tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Sumaama tumharey paas kya hai? To us ne kaha: Merey paas jo main ne tum se kaha. To Aap ne farmaya: Sumaama ko chhoro. To wo masjid key qareeb khajoor ki taraf gaya aur ghusl kya. Phir masjid mein daakhil hua aur us ne kaha: Main gawahi deta hun ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad Allah key Rasool hain. Ae Muhammad! Allah ki qasam zameen par chehra merey paas tumharey chehrey se zyada naapasandeeda na tha. To tumhaara chehra merey paas chehron mein sab se mehboob ho gaya hai. Aur Allah ki qasam deen mein se merey paas tumharey deen se zyada naapasandeeda na tha. To tumhaara deen merey paas deenon mein sab se mehboob ho gaya hai. Aur Allah ki qasam shehar mein se merey paas tumharey shehar se zyada naapasandeeda na tha. To tumhaara shehar merey paas shehron mein sab se mehboob ho gaya hai. Aur beshak tumhaarey sawaaron ne mujhey pakda jabke main Umrah ka iraada karta tha. To tumhaari kya raey hai? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use khushkhabri di aur use Umrah karney ka hukm diya. Phir jab wo Makkah aaya to us se kehney waley ne kaha: Tum deen badal gaey? Us ne kaha: Nahi, lekin main Muhammad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Musalman hua hun. Aur Allah ki qasam Yamaama se tumharey paas gehu ka daana na aaeyga yahan tak ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us mein ijazat dein. (Bukhari: 4372)"
"1688","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Musailima Kazzaab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein aaya. To wo kehney laga: Agar Muhammad merey liye apne baad muamla kar dey to main uski pairwi karunga. Aur wo apni qaum mein se bahut bashar mein aaya tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uski taraf aey jabke Aap key sath Saabit bin Qais bin Shammaas they jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key haath mein khajoor ki tehni ka tukda tha. Yahan tak ke Aap Musailima key paas uskey sahaaba mein khadey huey. To Aap ne farmaya: Agar tum mujh se ye tukda maango to main tumhey na dunga. Aur tum Allah key muamley mein us se aagey na badhogey jo tumhaarey baarey mein hai. Aur agar tum peeth morogey to Allah tumhey jad se kaateyga. Aur beshak main tumhey wahi dekhta hun jismein mujhey dikhaaya gaya jo main ne dekha. Aur ye Saabit tumhey meri taraf se jawaab dega. Phir Aap us se wapas aey. (Bukhari: 4373)"
"1689","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas ne kaha: To main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key qaul (beshak tum wahi ho jismein mujhey dikhaaya gaya jo mujhey dikhaaya gaya) key baarey mein poochha. To mujhey Abu Hurairah ne khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jabke main soya hua tha ke main ne apne donon haathon mein sonay key do kanghan dekhey. To mujhey unka muamla fikr mein daal gaya. To khwaab mein meri taraf wahi ki gai ke unhey phoonko. To main ne unhey phoonka aur wo ud gaey. To main ne unhey do jhooton se taabeer kya jo merey baad nikalengey. Un mein aik_Ansi hai aur doosra Musailima. (Bukhari: 4374)"
"1690","[AI-translation] Aur Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se aik riwayat mein hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Har ummat ka ameen hai aur is ummat ka ameen Abu Ubaida bin Jarraah hai. (Bukhari: 4382). Ashaariyon aur Yaman walon ki aamad."
"1691","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ashaariyon mein se giroh Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey aur Aap se sawaari maangi. To Aap ne hamein sawaari deney se inkaar kar diya. To Aap se sawaari maangi aur Aap ne qasam khai ke Aap hamein sawaari na dengey. Phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko der na hui ke Aap key paas loota hua oont laaya gaya. To Aap ne hamaarey liye paanch jawaan oontniyon ka hukm diya. Phir jab ham ne unhey qabz kar liya to ham ne kaha: Ham ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko uski qasam se ghaafil paaya. Ham uskey baad kabhi kaamyaab na honge. To main Aap key paas aaya aur main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak tum ne qasam khai thi ke tum hamein sawaari na dogey jabke tum ne hamein sawaari di hai. Aap ne farmaya: Haan, lekin main qasam par qasam nahi khaata aur uskey siwa behtar dekhta hun magar usey karta hun jo us se behtar hai aur use khol deta hun. (Bukhari: 4385)"
"1692","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Tumharey paas Yaman waley aey hain. Wo naram dil aur naram qalb waley hain. Imaan Yaman hai aur hikmat Yamani hai. Aur fakhr aur takabbur oont walon mein hai. Aur sukoon aur waqaar bakri walon mein hai. (Bukhari: 4388). Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Fatah key saal aey jabke Aap Usaama ko Qaswa par apne peechey sawaar kiye huey they. Aur Aap key sath Bilaal aur Usmaan bin Talha they. Yahan tak ke Aap Bait key paas utrey. Phir Aap ne Usmaan se farmaya: Hamaarey paas chaabi laao. To wo Aap key paas chaabi ley kar aaya aur us ne Aap key liye darwaaza khola. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Usaama aur Bilaal aur Usmaan daakhil huey, phir unhon-ne un par darwaaza band kar diya. To wo lamba din thehrey. Phir nikley aur log daakhil honay key liye dauday. To main un se pehley badha aur Bilaal ko darwaazey key peechey khada paaya. To main ne us se kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kahaan namaz padhi? To us ne kaha: Aap ne donon aagey waley sutoonon key darmiyaan namaz padhi. Jabke Bait chhe sutoonon par tha, do qataaron mein. Aap ne aagey wali qataar key donon sutoonon key darmiyaan namaz padhi. Aur Bait ka darwaaza apni peeth key peechey kya. Aur apne chehrey se uski taraf mutawajjeh huey jise tum dekhtey ho jab tum Bait mein daakhil hotey ho, uskey aur deewar key darmiyaan. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur main poochhna bhool gaya ke Aap ne kitni padhi. Aur us jagah key paas jahaan Aap ne namaz padhi surkh sangmarmar hai. (4400). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai. Widaa key Hajj."
"1693","[AI-translation] Abu Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Zamaana ghoom gaya hai jaisa wo us din tha jis din aasmaan aur zameen paida kiye gaey they. Saal baarah mahiney hai. Un mein chaar hurmat waley hain. Teen lagataar: Zul Qaada aur Zul Hijja aur Muharram. Aur Mudar ka Rajab jo Jumaada aur Shaban key darmiyaan hai. Ye kaunsa mahina hai? Ham ne kaha: Allah aur uska Rasool zyada jaantey hain. To Aap khaamosh rahey yahan tak ke ham ne gumaan kya ke Aap use uskey naam key siwa naam dengey. Aap ne farmaya: Kya Zul Hijja nahi hai? Ham ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Aap ne farmaya: To ye kaunsa shehar hai? Ham ne kaha: Allah aur uska Rasool zyada jaantey hain. To Aap khaamosh rahey yahan tak ke ham ne gumaan kya ke Aap use uskey naam key siwa naam dengey. Aap ne farmaya: Kya shehar nahi hai? Ham ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Aap ne farmaya: To ye kaunsa din hai? Ham ne kaha: Allah aur uska Rasool zyada jaantey hain. To Aap khaamosh rahey yahan tak ke ham ne gumaan kya ke Aap use uskey naam key siwa naam dengey. Aap ne farmaya: Kya Qurbani ka din nahi hai? Ham ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak tumhaarey khoon aur tumhaarey maal aur tumhaari izzatein tum par haraam hain. Jaisey tumhaarey is din ki hurmat tumhaarey is shehar mein tumhaarey is mahiney mein. Aur tum apne Rab se milogey aur wo tum se tumhaarey aamaal key baarey mein poochhega. Khabardaar! Merey baad gumraah ho kar wapas na ho ke tum mein se baaz baaz ki gardanein maaray. Khabardaar! Haaazir ghaaeb ko pahunchaaey. Shayed baaz jise pahunchaaya jaey wo baaz se zyada yaad rakhney wala ho jis ne use suna. Khabardaar! Kya main ne pahuncha diya? Do martaba. (Bukhari: 4406)"
"1694","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) ki Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Kaaba mein namaz key baarey mein hadees guzar chuki hai. Aur is riwayat mein zikr kya, unhon-ne kaha: Aur us jagah key paas jahaan Aap ne namaz padhi surkh sangmarmar hai."
"1695","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Arqam (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unnees ghazwe kiye. Aur beshak Aap ne hijrat key baad aik Hajj kya. Uskey baad Hajj na kya. Widaa key Hajj (mein). (Bukhari: 4404)"
"1696","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Widaa key Hajj mein halq kya aur Aap key sahaaba mein se logon ne. Aur baaz ne qasr kya. (Bukhari: 4411). Tabook ka ghazwa jo Usrat ka ghazwa hai."
"1697","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Merey sahaaba ne mujhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf bheja taake main unkey liye sawaariyaan maangun. Jabke wo Aap key sath Usrat key lashkar mein they jo Tabook ka ghazwa hai. To main ne kaha: Ae Allah key Nabi! Beshak merey sahaaba ne mujhey tumhaari taraf bheja hai taake tum unhey sawaar karo. To Aap ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam main tumhey kisi cheez par sawaar na karunga. Aur main Aap ko ghussay mein paaeyga aur mujhey maloom na tha. Aur main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key rokney aur is khauf se ghamgeen wapas aaya ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne dil mein mujh par (naaraazgi) paai hai. To main apne sahaaba ki taraf wapas aaya aur unhey wo khabar di jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha. To main thodi der na thehra ke main ne Bilaal ko suna jo pukaarta hai: Ae Abdullah bin Qais! To main ne use jawaab diya. To us ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko jawaab do, wo tumhey bulaatey hain. Phir jab main Aap key paas aaya to Aap ne farmaya: Ye do jodey lo. Aur ye do jodey, chhe oonton key liye jo Aap ne us waqt Saad se khareedey they. To unhey apne sahaaba ki taraf ley jao. Aur kaho: Beshak Allah, ya farmaya: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam), tumhey un par sawaar kartey hain, to un par sawaar ho. To main unhey unkey paas ley gaya aur main ne kaha: Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tumhey un par sawaar kartey hain. Lekin main Allah ki qasam tumhey na chhorunga yahan tak ke merey sath tum mein se baaz uskey paas chaley jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki baat sunay, tumhaarey rokney phir uskey baad deney mein. Tum ye gumaan na karo ke main ne tumhey hadees sunaai hai jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne nahi farmai. To unhon-ne mujh se kaha: Allah ki qasam beshak tum hamaarey paas sachey ho. Aur ham zaroor karengey jo tum pasand kartey ho. To Abu Musa un mein se giroh key sath chaley yahan tak ke wo unkey paas aey jinhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka qaul suna tha, unhey rokney phir unhey uskey baad deney mein. To unhon-ne unhey waisa bayan kya jaisa Abu Musa ne unhey bayan kya tha. (Bukhari: 4415)"
"1698","[AI-translation] Saad bin Abi Waqqaas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Tabook ki taraf nikley aur Ali ko khaleefa banaaya. To unhon-ne kaha: Kya tum mujhey bachchon aur auraton mein khaleefa banaatey ho? Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum raazi nahi ho ke tum mujh se Haaroon key Musa se martabey mein ho magar ye ke merey baad Nabi nahi hai. (Bukhari: 4416). Kaab bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees aur Allah Azza wa Jall key qaul: Aur un teen par jiney peechey chhora gaya."
"1699","[AI-translation] Kaab bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kisi ghazwe mein peechey na raha jismein Aap gaey hon magar Tabook key ghazwe mein. Siwa iskey ke main Badr key ghazwe mein peechey raha tha aur Aap ne us se peechey rehne waley kisi ko malaamat nahi ki. Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Quraish key qaafiley ka iraada kar key nikley they yahan tak ke Allah ne unhey aur unkey dushman ko baghair waaday jama kar diya. Aur beshak main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Aqaba ki raat haazir tha jab ham ne Islam par muaahida kya tha. Aur mujhey pasand nahi hai ke merey liye uskey badley Badr ka mashhad ho agarchey Badr logon mein us se zyada mashhoor hai. Meri khabar ye thi ke main kabhi itna taaqatwar aur khushhaal na tha jab main us ghazwe mein us se peechey raha. Aur Allah ki qasam us se pehley merey paas do sawaariyaan kabhi jama nahi huin thein yahan tak ke main ne unhey us ghazwe mein jama kya. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghazwe ka iraada na kartey magar uskey siwa se ishara kartey yahan tak ke wo ghazwa tha jismein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sakht garmi mein ghazwa kya. Aur lamba safar aur jungle aur bahut dushman ka isteqbaal kya. To Aap ne Musalmaanon key liye unka muamla wazeh kar diya taake wo apne ghazwe ki tayyaari karein. To Aap ne unhey apna rukh khabar diya jise Aap chaaahtey they. Jabke Musalman Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath bahut they aur unhey yaad rakhney wali kitaab jama nahi karti thi. Kaab ne kaha: To jo aadmi ghaaeb hona chaahta wo gumaan karta ke wo chhupa rahega jab tak uskey baarey mein Allah ki wahi naazil na ho. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us ghazwe mein ghazwa kya jab phal aur saaye umda huey. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Aap key sath Musalman tayyaar huey. To main subah jaata taake unkey sath tayyaar hun aur wapas aata aur kuchh na karta. To main apne dil mein kehta: Main us par qaadir hun. To wo mujh se badhta raha yahan tak ke logon mein koshish sakht hui. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Aap key sath Musalman subah huey jabke main ne apne saamaan mein se kuchh na kya tha. To main ne kaha: Main uskey baad aik ya do din mein tayyaar hunga, phir un se jaa milunga. To main subah gaya jab wo kooch kar chukey they taake tayyaar hun aur wapas aaya aur kuchh na kya. Phir main subah gaya phir wapas aaya aur kuchh na kya. To wo mujh se raha yahan tak ke wo tez gaey aur ghazwa guzar gaya. Aur main ne qasad kya ke main kooch karun aur unhey paaun. Kaash main ne kya hota! To merey liye muqaddar nahi hua. To jab main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key nikalney key baad logon mein nikalta aur un mein ghoomta to mujhey ghamgeen karta ke main sirf aadmi dekhta jis par nifaaq ka ilzaam tha ya aadmi un mein jo Allah ne kamzoron mein uzr diya tha. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey yaad nahi kya yahan tak ke Aap Tabook pahunch gaey. To Aap ne farmaya jab Aap Tabook mein qaum mein baithey they: Kaab ne kya kya? To Bani Salma mein se aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Use uski chaadar aur uskey pehlu mein dekhney ne rok diya hai. To Muaz bin Jabal ne kaha: Tum ne bura kaha! Allah ki qasam Ya Rasulullah ham ne us par bhalai key siwa nahi jaana. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khaamosh rahey. Kaab bin Maalik ne kaha: Phir jab mujhey pahuncha ke wo wapas aatey huey mutawajjeh huey hain to mera gham haazir hua. Aur main jhoot yaad karney laga aur kehta: Main kal uskey ghussay se kiskey sath niklunga? Aur us par apne ghar walon mein har raey waley se madad maangi. Phir jab kaha gaya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aatey huey saaya fighan ho chukey hain to mujh se baatil hat gaya. Aur main ne jaan liya ke main us se kabhi na niklunga kisi cheez key sath jismein jhoot ho. To main ne uskey sach ka pukhta iraada kya. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aatey huey subah huey. Jabke Aap jab safar se aatey to masjid se shuru kartey aur us mein do rakatein padhtey, phir logon key liye baithey. Phir jab Aap ne wo kya to Aap key paas peechey rehne waley aey aur wo Aap se uzr karney lagey aur Aap key liye qasmein khaane lagey. Jabke wo assi se zyada aadmi they. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se unka zaahir qabool kya aur un se baiat ki aur unkey liye maghfirat maangi aur unkey dil Allah key supurd kiye. To main Aap key paas aaya. Phir jab main ne Aap ko salaam kya to Aap ghussay waley ki muskurahat muskuraye, phir farmaya: Aao! To main chalta hua aaya yahan tak ke main Aap key saamney baitha. To Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Tumhey kis ne peechey rakkha? Kya tum ne apni peeth nahi khareedi thi? To main ne kaha: Kyun nahi! Beshak main Allah ki qasam agar duniya walon mein se tumharey siwa kisi key paas baithta to raey dekhta ke main uskey ghussay se uzr key sath niklunga. Aur beshak mujhey jhagda diya gaya hai. Lekin main Allah ki qasam jaan chuka hun ke agar main aaj tumhey jhooti baat sunaun jis se tum mujh se raazi ho jaao to jald Allah tumhey mujh par naraaz karega. Aur agar main tumhey sachi baat sunaun jismein tum mujh par ghussa karogey to beshak main us mein Allah key maaf karney ki ummeed rakhta hun. Nahi, Allah ki qasam merey paas uzr na tha. Aur Allah ki qasam main kabhi itna taaqatwar aur khushhaal na tha jitna jab main tum se peechey raha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Lekin ye sachcha raha. To utho yahan tak ke Allah tumhaarey baarey mein faisla karey. To main utha aur Bani Salma mein se aadmi uthay aur merey peechey aey. To unhon-ne mujh se kaha: Allah ki qasam ham ne tumhey nahi jaana ke tum ne is se pehley gunaah kya tha. Aur beshak tum aajiz rahey ke tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se uzr na kar sakay jaisa peechey rehne walon ne Aap se uzr kya. Tumhaarey gunaah key liye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka tumharey liye maghfirat maangna kaafi hota. To Allah ki qasam wo mujhey malaamat kartey rahey yahan tak ke main ne chaaha ke main wapas jaaun aur apne aap ko jhutlaaun. Phir main ne un se kaha: Kya merey sath isey kisi ne paaya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Do aadmiyon ne waisa kaha jaisa tum ne kaha. To un donon se waisa kaha gaya jaisa tum se kaha gaya. To main ne kaha: Wo donon kaun hain? Unhon-ne kaha: Muraara bin Rabi Amri aur Hilaal bin Umayya Waaqifi. To unhon-ne mujhey do nek aadmi zikr kiye jinhon-ne Badr mein haazri di thi, un donon mein namoona hai. To main chala jab unhon-ne un donon ko mujhey zikr kya. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Musalmaanon ko ham teenon se baat karney se mana kya jo us se peechey rahey they. To log ham se kat gaey aur hamarey liye badal gaey. Yahan tak ke merey dil mein zameen anjaan ho gai, wo nahi hai jo main pehchaanta hun. To ham us par pachaas raatein thehrey. Lekin merey donon saathi aajiz huey aur apne gharon mein baithey aur rotey rahey. Aur main qaum mein sab se jawaan aur mazboot tha. To main nikalta aur Musalmaanon key sath namaz mein haazir hota aur baazaaron mein ghoomta jabke mujh se koi baat na karta. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aata aur Aap ko salaam karta jabke Aap namaz key baad apni majlis mein hotey. To main apne dil mein kehta: Kya Aap ne apne honth merey salaam key jawaab se hilaaye hain ya nahi? Phir Aapkey qareeb namaz padhta aur Aap ko chori se dekhta. Phir jab main apni namaz ki taraf mutawajjeh hota to Aap meri taraf mutawajjeh hotey. Aur jab main Aapki taraf tawajjeh karta to Aap mujh se munh mortey. Yahan tak ke jab mujh par logon ki judai lambi hui to main chala yahan tak ke Abu Qataada key baagh ki deewar phaaandi. Jabke wo mera chacha zaad bhai aur mujhey logon mein sab se mehboob tha. To main ne use salaam kya. To Allah ki qasam us ne mujhey salaam ka jawaab na diya. To main ne kaha: Ae Abu Qataada! Main tumhey Allah ka waasta deta hun, kya tum mujhey jaantey ho ke main Allah aur uskey Rasool se mohabbat rakhta hun? To wo khaamosh raha. To main uskey paas wapas aaya aur use qasam di aur wo khaamosh raha. To main uskey paas wapas aaya aur use qasam di. To us ne kaha: Allah aur uska Rasool zyada jaantey hain. To meri aankhein behnein lagein aur main wapas aaya yahan tak ke deewar phaaandi. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir jabke main Madina key baazaar mein chal raha tha ke Shaam walon key nabtiyon mein se nabti jo khaana ley kar aaya tha jo use Madina mein bechta tha kehta hai: Kaun mujhey Kaab bin Maalik ki raah dikhaaeyga? To log uski taraf ishaara karney lagey yahan tak ke jab wo merey paas aaya to us ne mujhey Ghassaan key baadshah ka khat diya. Phir us mein tha: Amma baad! Beshak mujhey pahuncha hai ke tumhaarey saathi ne tum se judai ki hai. Aur Allah ne tumhey zillat key ghar aur zaaya honay ki jagah nahi banaaya hai. To ham se jaa milo, ham tumhaari hamdardi karengey. To main ne jab use padha to kaha: Aur ye bhi aazmaish mein se hai. To main ne uskey sath tannoor ka iraada kya aur use us se jala diya. Yahan tak ke jab pachaas mein se chaalees raatein guzar gaein ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka bhejaney wala merey paas aaya. To us ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tumhey hukm detey hain ke tum apni biwi se alag ho. To main ne kaha: Kya main use talaaq dun ya main kya karun? Us ne kaha: Nahi, balke us se alag ho aur uskey qareeb na jao. Aur merey donon saathiyon ki taraf waisa bheja. To main ne apni biwi se kaha: Apne ghar walon se jaa milo aur unkey paas raho yahan tak ke Allah is muamley mein faisla karey. Kaab ne kaha: To Hilaal bin Umayya ki biwi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aai. To us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Hilaal bin Umayya budha zaaya honay wala hai jiska khaadim nahi hai. To kya tum naapasand kartey ho ke main uski khidmat karun? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, lekin wo tumharey qareeb na aaey. Us ne kaha: Beshak wo Allah ki qasam kisi cheez ki taraf harkat nahi rakhta. Aur Allah ki qasam wo rota raha jab se uska muamla tha jo tha us din tak. To merey ghar walon mein se baaz ne mujh se kaha: Kaash tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se apni biwi key baarey mein ijazat maangtey jaisa Aap ne Hilaal bin Umayya ki biwi ko ijazat di ke wo uski khidmat karey. To main ne kaha: Allah ki qasam main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se uskey baarey mein ijazat na maangunga. Aur mujhey kya maloom ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kya farmaaengey jab main Aap se uskey baarey mein ijazat maangun jabke main jawaan aadmi hun. To uskey baad das raatein thehra yahan tak ke hamaari pachaas raatein poori huin jab se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham se baat karney se mana kya tha. Phir jab main ne pachaas raaton ki subah Fajr ki namaz padhi jabke main hamaarey gharon mein se ghar ki chhat par tha. Phir jabke main us haalat mein baitha tha jo Allah ne zikr ki, mera dil mujh par tang ho gaya tha aur mujh par zameen apni kushaadgi key bawajood tang ho gai thi. To main ne cheekhney waley ki aawaaz suni jo Sala key pahaad par buland aawaaz se tha: Ae Kaab bin Maalik khushkhabri paao! Unhon-ne kaha: To main sajdey mein gira aur main ne jaan liya ke kushadgi aa gai hai. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham par Allah ki tauba ka elaan kya jab Aap ne Fajr ki namaz padhi. To log hamein khushkhabri deney gaey aur merey donon saathiyon ki taraf khushkhabri denay waley gaey. Aur aadmi ghodey par meri taraf dauda aur Aslam mein se daudney wala pahaad par chadha. Aur aawaaz ghodey se tez thi. Phir jab merey paas wo aaya jiski aawaaz main ne suni thi jo mujhey khushkhabri deta tha to main ne uskey liye apne donon kapdey utaaray aur use uski khushkhabri key badley pehnaaey. Aur Allah ki qasam us din merey paas unkey siwa na they. Aur main ne do kapdey mustaar liye aur pehney aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf chala. To mujh se log giroh giroh miltey jo mujhey tauba ki mubaarak detey. Wo kehtey: Tumhey Allah ki tum par tauba mubaarak ho! Kaab ne kaha: Yahan tak ke main masjid mein daakhil hua aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baithey they jabke Aap key gird log they. To meri taraf Talha bin Ubaidullah daudtey huey uthay yahan tak ke mujh se musaafa kya aur mujhey mubaarak di. Aur Allah ki qasam Muhaajireen mein se merey paas uskey siwa aadmi na utha. Aur main use Talha key liye nahi bhoolta. Kaab ne kaha: Phir jab main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko salaam kya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jabke Aapka chehra khushi se chamakta tha: Behtareen din ki khushkhabri paao jo tum par guzra hai jab se tumhaari maan ne tumhey jana hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Kya tumhaari taraf se Ya Rasulullah ya Allah ki taraf se? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, balke Allah ki taraf se. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab khush hotey to Aapka chehra roshan hota yahan tak ke goya chaand ka tukda hai. Aur ham Aap se use pehchaantey they. Phir jab main Aap key saamney baitha to main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak meri tauba mein se hai ke main apne maal se nikal jaun jo Allah aur uskey Rasool ki taraf sadqa hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne maal mein se baaz apne paas rakkho, wo tumharey liye behtar hai. Main ne kaha: Beshak main apna hissa rakkhunga jo Khaibar mein hai. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Allah ne mujhey sach key sath najaat di hai. Aur beshak meri tauba mein se hai ke main sach key siwa na kahunga jab tak baaqi rahun. To Allah ki qasam main Musalmaanon mein se kisi ko nahi jaanta jise Allah ne sach baat mein aazmaaya ho jab se main ne wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko zikr ki us se behtar jaisa mujhey aazmaaya. Main ne us se jab se main ne wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko zikr ki aaj key din tak jaan boojh kar jhoot nahi kaha. Aur beshak mujhey ummeed hai ke Allah mujhey bachaayega jismein baaqi rahun. Aur Allah ne apne Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par naazil farmaya: (Beshak Allah ne Nabi aur Muhaajireen aur Ansaar par tauba ki) uskey qaul (Aur sachey walon key sath ho) tak. To Allah ki qasam Allah ne mujh par koi naimat kabhi us se badi nahi ki jo us ne mujhey Islam ki hidaayat key baad ata ki, merey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko sach bolney se ke main Aap se jhoot na bolun aur halaak hun jaisa jhoot bolney waley halaak huey. Beshak Allah ne jhoot bolney walon se farmaya jab wahi naazil ki jo kisi se kaha us se bura. To Allah ne farmaya: (Wo jald Allah ki qasam khaaengey tumhaarey liye jab tum unki taraf wapas aao) uskey qaul (Beshak Allah naafarmaan qaum se raazi nahi hota) tak. Kaab ne kaha: Aur ham teenon peechey reh gaey they unkey muamley se jinkay Aap ne qabool kya tha. Jab unhon-ne Aap key liye qasam khai to Aap ne un se baiat ki aur unkey liye maghfirat maangi. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamaara muamla moakkhar kya yahan tak ke Allah ne us mein faisla kya. To uskey sath Allah ne farmaya: (Aur un teen par jo peechey chhorey gaey). Aur wo nahi hai jo Allah ne zikr kya hamarey ghazwe se peechey rehne mein. Beshak wo hamaara peechey chhorna aur hamaara muamla moakkhar karna hai us se jis ne Aap key liye qasam khai aur Aap se uzr kya aur Aap ne us se qabool kya. (Bukhari: 4418)"
"1700","[AI-translation] Abu Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Allah ne mujhey kalimat key sath faeda diya jo main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Jamal key dinon mein suni thi, uskey baad ke main qareeb tha ke Jamal walon se jaa milun aur unkey sath ladun. Unhon-ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko pahunchi ke Faaris walon ne apne upar Kisra ki beti ko baadshah banaaya hai to Aap ne farmaya: Qaum kabhi kaamyaab na hogi jis ne apna muamla aurat ko sonpa. (Bukhari: 4425). Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne us marz mein farmatey they jismein Aap faut huey: Ae Aisha! Main Khaibar mein khaaye huey khaaney ka dard paata rehta hun. To ye waqt hai jab main ne us zeher se meri shahrag kat-ti hui paai hai. (4428). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka marz aur Aapki wafaat."
"1701","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Faatima (Raziallahu anha) ko apni us beemaari mein bulaaya jismein Aap faut huey. To Aap ne un se sargoshi ki aur wo roein. Phir unhey bulaaya aur un se sargoshi ki aur wo hanseen. To ham ne uskey baarey mein poochha. To unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se sargoshi ki ke wo apne us dard mein faut hongey jismein Aap faut huey. To main roi. Phir Aap ne mujh se sargoshi ki aur mujhey khabar di ke main Aap key ghar walon mein sab se pehli hun jo Aap key peechey aaeygi. To main hansi. (Bukhari: 4434)"
"1702","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Aisha Raziallahu anha se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main sunti thi ke Nabi na marta hai yahan tak ke use duniya aur aakhirat key darmiyaan ikhtiyaar diya jaata hai. To main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko us marz mein farmatey huey suna jismein Aap faut huey jabke Aap ko gala baith gaya tha, Aap farma rahey they: (Unkey sath jin par Allah ne inaam kya) aayat. To main ne gumaan kya ke use ikhtiyaar diya gaya hai. (Bukhari: 4435)"
"1703","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Aisha Raziallahu anha se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tandrust hotey huey farmaatey they: Beshak Nabi kabhi faut nahi hota yahan tak ke wo Jannat mein apna thikaana dekhey, phir use zinda kya jaey ya ikhtiyaar diya jaey. Phir jab Aap beemaar huey aur Aap par maut haazir hui jabke Aapka sar Aisha ki god mein tha to Aap par behoshi chhaa gai. Phir jab Aap jaagey to Aapki nigaah ghar ki chhat ki taraf uthi. Phir farmaya: Ae Allah! Buland saathi mein! To main ne kaha: Phir wo hamara padosi na hoga. To main ne jaan liya ke wo Aapki hadees hai jo Aap hamein bayan kartey they jab Aap tandrust they. (Bukhari: 4437)"
"1704","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Aisha Raziallahu anha se) riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab beemaar hotey to apne aap par Muawwizaat se phoonktey aur apne haath se ponchhtey. Phir jab Aap apne us dard mein beemaar huey jismein Aap faut huey to main Aap par un Muawwizaat se phoonkney lagi jo Aap phoonktey they aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key haath se Aap ko ponchhti. (Bukhari: 4439)"
"1705","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf kaan lagaaya Aapkey faut honay se pehley jabke Aap meri taraf apni peeth tikaye huey they. Aap farma rahey they: Ae Allah! Mujhey maaf farma aur mujh par rehem farma aur mujhey buland saathi se mila! (Bukhari: 4440)"
"1706","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Aisha Raziallahu anha se) aik riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) faut huey jabke Aap merey seeney aur thodi key darmiyaan they. To main kisi key liye Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key baad maut ki sakhti ko naapasand nahi karti. (Bukhari: 4446)"
"1707","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Ali bin Abi Taalib (Raziallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas se us dard mein nikley jismein Aap faut huey. To logon ne kaha: Ae Abul Hasan! Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kaisi subah ki? To unhon-ne kaha: Allah ki hamd key sath tandrust subah ki. To unka haath Abbas bin Abdul Muttalib ne pakda aur unhon-ne us se kaha: Tum Allah ki qasam teen key baad laathi key ghulaam ho! Aur beshak main Allah ki qasam Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekh raha hun ke wo apne is dard mein faut hongey. Beshak main Bani Abdul Muttalib key chehrey maut key waqt pehchaanta hun. Hamaarey sath Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf chalo. To ham Aap se poochhein ke ye muamla kismein hai. Agar wo ham mein ho to ham use jaan lengey. Aur agar wo hamarey siwa mein ho to ham use jaan lengey aur wo hamarey liye wasiyat karega. To Ali ne kaha: Beshak ham Allah ki qasam agar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se use maangengey aur wo hamein mana karengey to log hamein uskey baad na dengey. Aur beshak main Allah ki qasam Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se use na maangunga. (Bukhari: 4447)"
"1708","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke wo kehti thein: Beshak Allah ki mujh par naimaton mein se hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) merey ghar mein aur merey din mein aur merey seeney aur halq key darmiyaan faut huey. Aur ke Allah ne meri thook aur Aapki thook ko Aapki maut key waqt jama kar diya. Merey paas Abdur Rahman daakhil huey jabke unkey haath mein miswaak thi jabke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko tikaye huey thi. To main ne Aap ko uski taraf dekhta hua dekha aur main ne jaan liya ke wo miswaak pasand kartey hain. To main ne kaha: Kya main use tumhaarey liye lun? To Aap ne apne sar se ishaara kya ke haan. To main ne use liya aur us par sakht hua. Aur main ne kaha: Kya main use tumhaarey liye naram karun? To Aap ne apne sar se ishaara kya ke haan. To main ne use naram kya. To Aap ne use phera. Aur Aap key saamney pyaala ya dabba tha, Umar ko shak hua, jismein paani tha. To Aap apney donon haath paani mein daakhil karney lagey aur un se apna chehra ponchhtey. Aap farmaatey: Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi! Beshak maut key liye behoshiyaan hain. Phir Aap ne apna haath khada kya aur kehnay lagey: Buland saathi mein! Yahan tak ke Aap faut ho gaey aur Aapka haath jhuk gaya. (Bukhari: 4449)"
"1709","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Aisha Raziallahu anha se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham ne Aap ko Aap key marz mein dawa pilai. To Aap hamein ishaara karney lagey ke mujhey dawa na pilaao. To ham ne kaha: Beemaar ka dawa se nafrat karna. Phir jab Aap jaagey to Aap ne farmaya: Kya main ne tumhey dawa pilaanay se mana nahi kya tha? Ham ne kaha: Beemaar ka dawa se nafrat karna. To Aap ne farmaya: Ghar mein koi baaqi na rahey magar dawa pilai jaeygi jabke main dekh raha hun, Abbas key siwa, beshak wo tumharey paas haazir na tha. (Bukhari: 4458)"
"1710","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhaari ho gaey to Aap par behoshi chhaaey lagi. To Faatima (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha: Haey merey waalid ki takleef! To Aap ne un se farmaya: Aaj key baad tumharey waalid par takleef nahi hai. (Bukhari: 4462)"
"1711","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) faut huey jabke Aap tirsath saal key they. (Bukhari: 4466). Tafseer ki kitaab."
